          "ocr_text": "S- And they stood up in their place and read from the Book of the law of the Lord their God for ¼ of the day and for another ¼ of the day they confessed and worshipped the Lord their God. Neh 9:3\nO- For 16 hrs they read the Bible, worshipped and confessed sins.\nA- We should spend more time confessing sins to God and each other\nP- Father I'm sorry that I became more passionate about other things than you. Please help me to love you more. Amen",
