          "import_seq": 10000,
          "journal_date": "2025-02-02",
          "ocr_text": "S- Here we are servants today. And the land that you gave to our fathers, to eat its fruit and its bounty, here we are servants in it. Nehemiah 5:6\n\nO- They recognized they were servants and didn't like it. Strange they didn't see they were servants to King Solomon\n\nA- Solomon took israel from being free to being in bondage. No human was called to be king. Only God.\n\nP- Lord help me to only desire you as king. I'm sorry and confess that I have desired men to be my king more than I have desired you to be king of my life. I dedicate all I am to you today. Thank you for your mercy and grace.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212415200.jpeg",
