          "journal_date": "2025-08-08",
          "ocr_text": "S- Being confident of this very thing that he who began a good work in you will complete it until the day of Jesus Christ. Phil 1:6\n\nO- Jesus is the one who starts and He is the one who completes the good work in our life. We must cooperate.\n\nA- I should have confidence in what God is doing and completing in my life. He has a plan thats much greater than I can comprehend.\n\nP- God please give me faith to surrender to your spirit and your hand moving me in my life.",
