          "import_seq": 10001,
          "journal_date": "2025-02-03",
          "ocr_text": "S- This is a faithful saying and worthy of all acceptance that Christ Jesus came into the world to save sinners of whom I am chief. 1 Tim 1:15\n\nO- Paul being the greatest apostle admitted deep regret and failure. So did David. And Trump. All great people need Jesus. Saul tried to be great without repentance and ended up in hell.\n\nA- I must always be humble and repent of wrong doing. Always admit when I'm wrong but strive to be the best I can be.\n\nP- God please give me grace to live a life of humility, honesty and purity.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212415200.jpeg",
