          "import_seq": 11002,
          "journal_date": "2025-02-08",
          "ocr_text": "S- Do not let a widow under 60's old be taken into the number and let unless she has been the wife of one man. I Tim 5:8, 16\n\nO- Paul takes length to identify those who really needed it. He recognized he was called to specifically help the helpers who were contributing and givers. They would be left out if they tried to help everyone.\n\nA- When trying to help everyone, I help no one. I must identify my main target.\n\nP- God help me identify my consumer and my target.",
