          "import_seq": 12000,
          "journal_date": "2025-02-10",
          "ocr_text": "S- Let the elders who rule well be counted worthy of double honor, especially those who labor in the word and doctrine. 1 Tim 5:17\n\nO- How does this relate to Judges and much the lengths. He uses paid to bless what people did. Elders are paid to teach the word.\n\nA- it's okay to be paid to preach the word of God. the word is determined by God and not man. If the word is a life message or one that God places on my heart.\n\nP- God help me to be able to be totally free of stress of finances.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212457440.jpeg",
