          "ocr_text": "S- For what is our hope or joy or crown of rejoicing? Is it not even you in the presence of our Lord Jesus Christ at his coming? For you are our glory and joy. 1 Thess 2:19,20\n\nG- Paul was saying that when Christ returns, the joy of his heart would be to see those souls saved because of the gospel shared that saves from God's wrath.\n\nA- If I truly believe Jesus is returning and the gospel will save people from wrath, I should do everything I can to love people into the kingdom.\n\nP- God, help me to prioritize souls more than anything in the world.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212457440.jpeg",
