          "ocr_text": "S- You shall consecrate them that they may be holy and whatsoever touches them must be holy. Ex 30:29\nO- In the context of this passage, the people are to consecrate themselves and the articles do not consecrate or make people holy. Only the sacrifice does and even the priests die if they aren't sanctified. Only Jesus could make the unclean clean. Is there no fulfillment of the laws\nA- Only Jesus can make me clean. No one else. I must live to worship him.\nP- Jesus, thank you that you were the perfect sacrifice and the high priest that has made a way for me to be with you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
