          "ocr_text": "S - Therefore the people who were with him when he called Lazarus out of the tomb and raised him from the dead bore witness. For this reason the people also met him because they heard that He had done this sign. John 20:31\n\nO - They defeated him by the blood of the lamb, the word of their testimony \u0026 loved not their lives unto the death. Rev 12:11. The Holy Spirit will come upon you and you will be my witnesses. John's Acts 1:8\n\nA - Disciples - Fish, Follow, Fellowship\nCrowd - Curious\nPharases - Jealous ~ Anti\nStans gave revelation to Disciples. They knew the word \u0026 it came alive when miracles happened when they were with Jesus \u0026 Jesus.\n\nP - God help me to stay plugged into you \u0026 others",
