          "ocr_text": "S- Why was this fragrant oil not sold for 300 denarii? and given to the poor? John 12:5\nO- Judas was criticizing someone else's gift instead of focusing on his own. When someone is a thief, when they are not giving, they will criticize others who give or will judge.\nMichael \u0026 David, Cain \u0026 Abel, Mary and Judas, Lucifer, Daniel \u0026 kings, advisors, Esther \u0026 Haman. It's a thirst for worship.\nA- I don't want to thirst for wealth, worship. I want to be a servant. Many view themselves as servants but don't give. I didn't ever want to criticize someone else's worship.\nP- God please help me to worship you with my heart soul mind \u0026 strength",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212638630.jpeg",
