          "ocr_text": "1:50\n\nS- For not daughter of Zion behold your king is coming. Sitting on a donkey: ass. o- Donkeys had a symbol of Peace. Solomon \u0026 david both rode donkeys but donkeys had a connotation of peace and prosperity.\n\nA- Jesus riding on a colt symbolized he had come first for peace. Not to take over. He will do that later.\n\nP- Lord help me to understand the signs of the time. And to have a heart of to servant.",
