          "journal_date": "2025-04-24",
          "ocr_text": "S - Then there appeared to them divided tongues as of fire and one set on each of them and they all filled with the Holy Spirit and began to speak in other tongues as the Spirit gave them utterance. Acts 2:34\n\nO - Fire consumes. Sacrifices that are pleasing to God. These were waiting 10 days for the Holy Spirit and will unity. Jesus waited 40 days. Spirit hovered over waters.\n\nA - I need to be still and wait to be an acceptable sacrifice to God. Marinate. Soak in His presence.\n\nP - God help me to marinate in you. Then ple consume me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
