          "import_seq": 24001,
          "journal_date": "2025-03-16",
          "ocr_text": "S- Then the righteous will answer him saying Lord when did we see you hungry and feed you or thirsty and give you drink or naked and clothe you or sick and in prison and visit you and the king will answer them. Assuredly I say to you inasmuch as you did it to the least of these you did it unto me. Mt 25:31-46\nO- Jesus I identify with the poor, imprisoned, sick, hungry and thirsty. The righteous didn't identify the poor with Jesus.\nA- The poor are always with us. How can I help the poor? 10% of budget should go to poor w/ conditions of Timothy.\nP- God help me to be a faithful steward of all you have given to me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
