          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "92dd35f0-ba81-4182-b1a7-177f8122c0e0",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 25002,
          "journal_date": "2025-03-20",
          "ocr_text": "S- By faith Abel offered to God a more excellent sacrifice than Cain through which he obtained a witness that he was righteous, God testifying of his gifts and through it, he being dead still speaks- Heb 11:4\nO- How does a dead still speak? God told Cain your brother's blood calls out to me from the ground. His righteousness from the sacrifice spoke to God after he died and continues to speak till this day.\nA- Our sacrifice has a voice. It has a legacy that is NEVER SILENCED. The woman that gave all was recorded and continues to speak about her till this day. When we sacrifice for the Lord, it is something that is NEVER FORGOTTEN.\nP- God, help me to have eternal eyes that seek to give you what is worthy of you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212663376.jpeg",
