          "import_seq": 27002,
          "journal_date": "2025-03-29",
          "ocr_text": "S- This he said not because he cared for the poor but because he was a thief and he used to take what was put in it. John 12:6\nO- Jesus knew Judas was a thief and still allowed him to handle the money box. God may call sin and put the tree in the middle of the garden. He allowed Judas to slaughter the priests. Ahead Judas to go back on his word.\nA- God's permission doesn't equate to His approval. 1:20pm\nP- God you are Patient. Help me to use your trust permission and patience to repent.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212638630.jpeg",
