          "ocr_text": "S - Nor was there anyone among them who lacked. For all who were possessors of lands, or houses sold them and brought the proceeds of the things that were sold and laid them at the apostles feet and they distributed to each as anyone had need. Acts 4:32,35\nO - No record of apostles buying jets, boats, horses, million dollar homes. No payment for healing.\nA - Money given to the church was given to the poor.\nP - God help our church to be like the church of Acts.",
