          "ocr_text": "S- If a brother or sister is naked and destitute of daily food and one of you says to them Depart in peace be warm and filled but you do not give them the things which are needed for the body what does it profit? James 2:15,16\n\nO- We need our actions to match our words. We need to feed the hungry and clothe the naked and show Gods love in a practical way to others.\n\nA- The interest of the money should go to those who need it. I need to send out email to God what the need is.\n\nP- God please help us to be a blessing to our community.",
