          "import_seq": 7001,
          "journal_date": "2025-01-01",
          "ocr_text": "Lessons from Matt 25\n\n• Not how much you have but what you do with what you have.\n\n• Likes not Loiter - Deal with it. - Multiply what you get.\n\n• God expects us to increase what he's given.\n\n• Obstacles\n  • Fear that God was harsh - knew God will meet your debts\n  • In Comparison of wealthy - Don't judge others.\n  • Protecting from loss is good enough      (Stewardship\n                                            bliss others)\n\n• Know God is for you. Expect him to bless you - Jesus\n\n• Don't compare \u0026 Judge @ Steward's celebrate\n\n• Not losing isn't winning. Invest.\n\n• Starting amount is not what we are judged on, it's what we do with what we've allowed\n\n  What do we stewarded - Time talent treasure\n  Time/Attention - Talent - Treasure\n\nMake Money =\n\nManage - Budgeting\n\nMobilizing - Investing\n\nMultiplying - Scaling",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212503678.jpeg",
