          "ocr_text": "S - Then I saw an angel standing in the sun and he cried with a loud voice saying to all the birds that fly in the midst of heaven, \"come gather together for the supper of God\", that you may eat the flesh of captains, the flesh of mighty men, the flesh of horses and of those who sit on them and the flesh of all people, free and slave, both small and great.\n\nO - Supper of God - Birds eating everyone who is against Jesus. The birds were gorged of their flesh.\n\nA - I will walk with a fear and awe for Jesus. I don't want to be counted as his enemy.\n\nP - God help me to wear the wedding clothes that is worthy of the celebration of the marriage of the LAMB.",
