          "ocr_text": "S - But when Sanballat the Horonite, Tobiah the Ammonite of Geshem the Arab heard of it they laughed at us and despised us and said \"What is this that you are doing? Will you rebel against the king?\"\n\nO - The enemies of Nehemiah were united by a hatred of Gods people. Nothing else. They saw security of others as insecurity for themselves.\n\nA - I need to know there will be opposition, and prepare for it as well, as rebuttals and prepare for those.\n\nP - God help me to anticipate and prepare for rebuttals, for supply, for enemies.",
