          "ocr_text": "S - Hear O God for we are despised. Turn their reproach on their own heads and give them as plunder to a land of captivity. Neh 4:4\n\nO - Previous chapter Nehemiah breaks the big task into many small assignments and incentivizes each one with a home. Then they prayed through threats.\n\nA - I should break up into small sections and incentivize the work.\n\nP - God give me wisdom to manage this well.",
