          "ocr_text": "S - And he will send Jesus who was preached to you before when heaven must receive until the time of restoration of all things which God has spoken from the mouth of all his holy prophets since the world began. Acts 3:22-21\n\nO - Jesus went up but he will return and his return is soon. We should be prepared.\n\nA - I should read and meditate on the Word to be prepared at what is to come.\n\nP - God help me to understand and to prepare my heart and be for your return.",
