          "ocr_text": "S - Children obey your parents in the Lord. For THIS IS right. Eph 6:1\n\nO - The word commands us that honor or obedience to parents is Biblical. That we can honor because honor is right.\n\nA - I will have an value based system of honor not merit. I won't wait til a person deserves it to honor them.\n\nP - God help me to always honor those and love you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
