          "import_seq": 35002,
          "journal_date": "2025-05-02",
          "ocr_text": "S- So continuing daily with one accord in the temple and breaking bread from house to house they ate their food with gladness and simplicity of heart. Acts 2:46\n\nO- There was a unity the church had in loving people more than things. They shared what they had and lived very simple lives.\n\nA- We tend to complicate things. They went door, house to house. They shared resources, gave to one another had to the poor. How much resources are in the church right now?\n\nP- God help us to have oneness of heart and a clear vision of how to help our isted",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212770197.jpeg",
