          "import_seq": 35000,
          "journal_date": "2025-04-30",
          "ocr_text": "S- The Lord said to my Lord sit at my right hand till I make your enemies your footstool. Acts 2:34,35\n\nO- It wasn't just good news of available salvation from sins but bad news that God was going to destroy them. The gospel is grace and truth. Truth that enemies of God will be destroyed and grace that we can be forgiven and become friends of God.\n\nA- When I share the gospel I must share both sides of grace and truth.\n\nP- God help me to apply this to my own life and walk in a healthy fear of you.\n\nWho how did Peter get this message? Read to Emmaus? Holy Spirit transformed Peter. He transforms us.\n\nWe all speak different languages to our culture. Have I neglected the Holy Spirit in my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212770197.jpeg",
