          "journal_date": "2025-05-03",
          "ocr_text": "S- Praising God and having favor with all the people. And the Lord added to the church daily those who were being saved. Acts 2:47\n\nO- The love and simplicity of these people were attractive to the world and the church grew as God added to them.\n\nA- Generosity was a key element of the early church. People could have wanted to be a part just to be provided for. But the Lord added. Not men.\n\nP- God help our community to grow in selflessness and simplicity before we try to grow in numbers.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
