          "ocr_text": "S - for if we have been united with Him in a death like this we shall certainly be united with Him in a resurrection like this. Rom 8:5\n\nO - Many saints died a death like His and will resurrect like Him. We believe a different gospel that since Jesus suffered, we wouldn't have to. \u0026 Christians who live in fear of covid \u0026 sickness\n\nA - I should make my purpose to die wells My life is not my own. He died for me. I ll live for\n\nP - God help me to live a spirit filled, spirit empowered life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
