          "ocr_text": "God created trees. Jesus gave them a purpose. Faith w/o works is dead. Work puts faith into action. Words can be cheap. Till you work.\nEndurance\nRom 5:1-5 suffering/Pressure - character = patience = hope\n\nHoly Spirit is the Boss in the live stream.\n\n6|3:8\n\nGotive Chapel - is there substance\n\nThe second I think I'm too good for something in good for something.\n\nThat's not my job. That's not my workplace",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
