          "ocr_text": "S - Then Peter said silver and gold I do not have but what I do have I give you. In the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth, rise up and walk. Acts 3:6\n\nO - Peter was different after the resurrection. Confident. Fearless. Bold. Powerful. And was crucified upside down. Didn't want to die like Jesus.\n\nA - I'm so far from being counted worthy. I have a hard time soaping.\n\nP - God help me to be more like Jesus. Help me not to be distracted by worthless things. Resurrection is real and will happen for all those who die. Choose to die like Christ.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
