          "journal_date": "2025-05-11",
          "ocr_text": "S - Therefore let all of Israel know assuredly that God made Jesus whom you crucified both Lord and Christ. Acts 2:36\n\nO - Peter pointed out their sin. Pointed of Jesus' lord ship. Pointed out their opportunity of salvation.\n\nA - I need to be reminded of my sin. How did sin hurt Jesus. Jesus invitation for me to be forgiven rested.\n\nP - God please help me to walk in gratitude to you for the forgiveness of my sin and your love for me to pay for it through your sacrifice.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
