          "import_seq": 34003,
          "journal_date": "2025-04-29",
          "ocr_text": "S- And with many other words he testified and exhorted them saying \"Be saved from this perverse\" generation. Acts 2:40\nO- We aren't just saved from our sin or saved from the penalty of sin but saved from a perverse generation.\nHe showed that this was a dark evil generation. It was crucified by Israel, and Israel would be judged.\nHe linked their sin against God and showed how bad that sin was and the judgement coming for that sin.\nA- Most don't see how this generation is sinning against God. Evolution credits chance instead of acknowledging a creator. DEI erases sin. No God. No sin. No accountability. What sins are we committing against God? What will He judge us for?\nP- God help me to share your Word in a way that cuts to the heart. Help me to see my need for you in every area of my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212783865.jpeg",
