          "ocr_text": "S- Then Peter said to them, \"Repent, and let everyone be baptized in the name of Jesus Christ for the remission of sins and you shall receive the gift of the Holy Spirit for the promise is to you, your children and to all who are afar off, as many as the Lord our God will call. Acts 2:38-39\n\nO- Peter cast vision of salvation of family which gave a legacy and impact of many nations. Gospel generated generational and global.\n\nA- We must keep our focus on the next generation and also the nations.\n\nP- God help me to think globally and generationally. Every Nation in our Generation",
