          "ocr_text": "S- Then Peter said \"Silver \u0026 Gold have I none, but such as I have give I thee. In the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth rise up and walk.\" Acts 3:6\n\nO- When thinking of the power of His resurrection and fellowship of His suffering, it seems much more time was spent experiencing His power. There was the \"Hour of Darkness\" where satan was given authority to kill Jesus, but He rose 3 days later.\n\nA- I should expect to suffer and endure trials but I should expect much greater power to be demonstrated in and through my life.\n\nP- Lord, thank you for your power and willingness to perform miracles in my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
