          "import_seq": 40001,
          "journal_date": "2025-05-21",
          "ocr_text": "S - Therefore those who were scattered went everywhere preaching the word. Phillip went down to the city of Samaria and preached Christ to them... And there was great joy in the city. Acts 8:4,8\n\nD - People who were scattered didn't lose faith or backslide like some college students but preached everywhere they went and miracles followed.\n\nA - Are we preaching the same gospel if the people who leave our church leave the faith?\n\nP - God help us to have the same kind of faith as the early church.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212859017.jpeg",
