          "ocr_text": "S - Now as He sat on Mt Olives the disciples came to Him privately saying \"Tell us when these things be? And what will be the sign of your coming and the end of the age? Mt 24:3\n\nO - Jesus was sitting at the location of where He will return. It is here he teaches about the second coming.\n\nA - I need to understand the signs. False prophets, wars, rumors of wars, nation against nation, famines, pestilence, earth quakes, persecution, lawlessness, world evangelism, signs \u0026 wonders, the his return. I want to be WISE, FAITHFUL, GENEROUS\n\nP - God help me to live 100% for you.",
