          "import_seq": 38003,
          "journal_date": "2025-05-15",
          "ocr_text": "S- And Stephen, full of faith and power did great wonders and signs among the people. Acts 6:8\n\nO- Stephen wasn't even one of the main apostles but was still full of faith and power.\n\nA- Anyone can move in the power, faith and authority of the Spirit if they have surrendered to Christ.\n\nP- God help me not to limit you, but to step out in faith to see you work miracles through me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212811997.jpeg",
