        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:42:42.738649+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "b8044500-4799-49eb-b000-b91d7fe25579",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 39003,
          "journal_date": "2025-05-19",
          "ocr_text": "S- But we will give ourselves to prayer and to the ministry of the Word - Then the Word of God spread and the number of disciples multiplied greatly in Jerusalem and a great many of the priests were obedient to the faith. Acts 6:4,7\nO- The apostles' main priority was prayer and the Word. Not social responsibility. That was given to responsible Spirit-filled men of good reputation.\nA- Even apostles couldn't do everything. They needed to prioritize prayer and the Word. I seem to have gotten it backwards.\nP- God help me to prioritize prayer \u0026 the word over every other thing in my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212798264.jpeg",
