          "import_seq": 40003,
          "journal_date": "2025-05-23",
          "ocr_text": "S - In my father's house are many rooms I go to prepare a place for you. And if I go to prepare a place for you I will come again and take you to myself that where I am you may be also. John 14:1-3\n\nO - Jesus is in love w/ his bride and is promising to come back for her. He promises to prepare a place for her. It is coming back \u0026 we. The new Jerusalem will come down from heaven and God will dwell with his people.\n\nA - I have been invited into a love relationship with Jesus. Nothing is worth more than His love and his presence.\n\nP - God, please give me a love for you. Help me to deposit all of my treasure into your kingdom",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212859017.jpeg",
