        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:43:32.528299+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "5728cbc5-a304-49e9-823d-f229273ab4a3",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 44000,
          "journal_date": "2025-06-05",
          "ocr_text": "S- But God demonstrates His love for us in that while we were yet sinners Christ died for us. Rom 5:8\n\nO- If we were sinners and Christ died for us, how much more does He love us when we repent and want to follow Him with our lives?\n\nA- I need to have a confidence in the unconditional love of God that loved me before I did anything for Him.\n\nP- God please help me to rest completely in your love for me and your finished work on the cross.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212884570.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212884570.jpeg"
          ],
