          "import_seq": 41002,
          "journal_date": "2025-05-24",
          "ocr_text": "S- For then there will be great tribulation such as has not been since the beginning of the world until this time no, nor ever shall be Matt 24:21\n\nO- The greatest victory will be preceded by the greatest suffering. Seed time harvest. Day night summer winter shall not cease. The greatest the darkness the bright the dawn.\n\nA- As we live in the time of the greatest opportunity, we also live in a time of the greatest coming suffering. Being able to let go of wealth may be needed to not suffer.\n\nP- Lord help me to live every day as if my faith is being tested and tried by the anti christ.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212833266.jpeg",
