          "import_seq": 42002,
          "journal_date": "2025-06-03",
          "ocr_text": "S - When the day of Pentecost had fully come they were all with one accord in one place. And suddenly there came a sound from heaven as of a rushing mighty wind and it filled the whole house where they were sitting. Then there appeared to them divided tongues as of fire and one sat upon each of them. And they were all filled with the Holy Spirit and began to speak with other tongues as the spirit gave them utterance.\n\nO - Every one was filled with the Spirit. Each one and each one spoke in tongues. It allowed them to speak to one another and understand one another.\n\nA - The Spirit will help us understand things of God and work in unity with each other.\n\nP - Where unity is God commands a blessing. Even forever more.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
