          "ocr_text": "S- Do not deprive one another except with consent for a time that you may give yourself to fasting and prayer and come together again so that Satan does not tempt you because of your lack of self control. I Cor 7:5\n\nO- Pray deprive. Fast \u0026 Pray. Helps strengthen self control to cast \u0026 prays. Keeps Satans temptations at bay.\n\nA- We should be giving ourselves to each other or giving ourselves to Christ by fasting \u0026 praying to not fall into sin.\n\nP- God help me to be faithful to you and to the spouse you have given to me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212869475.jpeg",
