          "ocr_text": "S- But he is a Jew who is one inwardly and circumcision is that of the heart, in the spirit, not in the letter whose praise is not from men but from God. Rom 2:29\n\nO- God looks at how I'm living. I need a fear of God that will make me a wise woman, but understand the love of God that will make me to be a faithful steward.\n\nA- I must meditate on the Fear of God so I live in a way that my oil is constantly filled. Oil will allow me to live prepared and sanctified and at rest.\n\nP- God help me to live in communion with your spirit that leads to rest and sanctification.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
