          "journal_date": "2025-06-12",
          "ocr_text": "S- Jesus is born. Satan attacks through murdering babies. John prepares the way. Jesus prepares himself. Desire goes through wilderness and overcomes. He builds a team. Starts ministry with healings signs and miracles. Matt 1:1-4\n\nO- Satan starts early. He tries to stop life before it starts but God divinely protects. God protects and prepares the way. provides followers for Jesus. Jesus was faithful all the time He was revealed.\n\nA- Jesus chose a team before he started his ministry. He isolated himself to fight the devil. They worked with miracles, Separation, Sacrifice, Supernaturall.\n\nP- God help me to separate and sanctify myself for your purposes.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212869475.jpeg",
