          "ocr_text": "S- Like wise you also reckon yourself to be dead to sin, alive to God in Christ Jesus our Lord. Therefore do not let sin reign in your mortal body that you should obey it in its lust. Rom 6: 11,12\n\nO- We can decide what we allow to reign in our bodies.\n\nA- I need to do everything to let righteousness reign in my body. To love God and others through the Power of Christ's love for me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212884570.jpeg",
