          "ocr_text": "S- Jesus demonstrated authority over sickness Satan, Sabbath, nature, sinners, sleeping/deaf, speaking/seeing. = Matt 8,1 \u0026 SENDING Matt 10\nO- Jesus demonstrated his authority over everything then He sends his disciples out. If I am sent by Jesus then He will give me authority.\nA- My \"job\" is to know Christ and be obedient to him. In the right time He will send and empower me to expand His kingdom with signs \u0026 wonders.\nP- God help me to be separated and sanctified. Help me to surrender to your spirit more than anything.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
