          "import_seq": 45001,
          "journal_date": "2025-06-14",
          "ocr_text": "S - Live for God and not men. Pray the Lord's Prayer. Fasting/Giving/Attention/Worry \u0026 Fear - Give all these things to God. Seek first his kingdom and all things will be given to you. Matt 6:34\nO - Everything Jesus talked about focused on the inside and relationship with God. Motives matter more than motion. Why we do something is more important than what we do.\nA - Jesus taught a different way to live. He modeled it then performed miracles to validate His words.\nP - God help me to focus on the things of the kingdom vs may.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212936535.jpeg",
