          "ocr_text": "S- Knowing that our old man was crucified with Him, that the body of sin might be done away with that we should no longer be slaves of sin. Rom 6:6\n\nO- When Jesus died, He took upon Himself my sin and now that my sin was crucified, I don't need to be a slave to sin.\n\nA- Everything I need was provided on the cross. If I am not walking in righteousness and freedom it is because I am not meditating in His word enough.\n\nP- God please help me to love you and meditate in your word.",
