          "ocr_text": "S - Jesus taught the kingdom. Calls them salt \u0026 light. Justifies the law. Speaks of heart vs behavior. Matt 5. Anger. Lust. Mourning. Oaths. Serving. Love enemies.\nO - Jesus taught on the inside us outside. What God sees us what man sees. Loving enemies.\nA - Living for the kingdom will set me apart from those living for this earth. Living for God will set me against those living for man.\nP - God let me live my life consistently for you without caring about the appearance before man. Help me to love those you called me to love. God calls me to be like God. Everything points to God.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212936535.jpeg",
