          "ocr_text": "S - Jesus demonstrated authority over sickness Satan, Sabbath, nature, sinners, sleeping/death, speaking/seeing + Matt 8,9 \u0026 SENDING - net 10\nO - Jesus demonstrated his authority over everything then He sends his disciples out. If I am sent by Jesus then He will give me authority.\nA - My \"job\" is to know Christ and be obedient to him. In the right time He will send and empower me to expand His kingdom with signs \u0026 wonders.\nP - God help me to be separated from the world and to go on to you. Help me to surrender to your spirit more than anything",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
