          "import_seq": 47002,
          "journal_date": "2025-06-23",
          "ocr_text": "S- Got the wise took oil in their vessels with their lamps. Matthew 25:4\n\nO- Everything on the outside is the same but all in the lamp is evident only to the one who has oil. What this verse does for me is not transferable to anyone else. The Holy Spirit is the one that uses the word to transform us on the inside. Revelation of the value of my private life before God, my relationship with the Holy Spirit, my time in the Word, my attention, my prayer life, my value system, my identity, my obedience are all invisible to man, but visible to God and to myself.\n\nA- As much as I want this Word to impact others, it is impossible to transfer revelation. It's impossible to transfer transformation. Oil: 1) is invisible to others 2) impossible to transfer 3) gives light in the dark 4) Required by Jesus on His return.\n\nP- God help me to be a wise servant that has oil in my lamp when you return.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212908395.jpeg",
