          "ocr_text": "S- But God demonstrates His love for us in that while we were yet sinners Christ died for us. Rom 5:8\n\nO- If we were sinners and Christ died for us, how much more does He love us when we repent and want to follow Him with our lives?\n\nA- I need to have a confidence in the unconditional love of God that loved me before I did anything for Him.\n\nP- God please help me to rest completely in your love for me and your finished work on the cross.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
