          "ocr_text": "S- Do the Spirit of God who raised Jesus from the dead dwells in you He who raised Jesus from the dead will also give life to your mortal bodies through His spirit who dwells in you. Rom 8:11\n\nO- The Spirit that raised Jesus from the dead lives in me and He will quicken my mortal body through the spirit that dwells in me.\n\nA- If Spirit is in me and is powerful then I should be filled with power and might. Nothing should discourage me.\n\nP- God please open my eyes to your Power in me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
