          "journal_date": "2025-06-17",
          "ocr_text": "S - Jesus SENT disciples with authority. He sent them to a people. Work among them. Get paid. Be worthy of your pay. Be someone of value to them. Share gospel. Move on to person of peace. You'll be persecuted. Represent Him. Expect rejection. Matt 10\n\nO - We are called to reach the people we live among. We should create value to the people we are reaching.\n\nA - God has already sent us by being in the market place. We need to minister in our marketplace.\n\nP - God help me to serve w/ power in the marketplace you sent me to",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
