          "ocr_text": "S- The master of that servant will come on a day when he is not looking for him and at an hour that he is not aware of and will cut him in two and appoint him his portion with the hypocrites. There shall be weeping and gnashing of teeth. Mt 24:50-51\n\nO- Jesus does a lot of killing, stomping, cutting, binding, throwing, casting out. There is a lot of judgement happening when Jesus comes back.\n\nA- I want to make sure I love Jesus or be loved by Him to be the motive of my stewardship and to be wise with my oil?\n\nP- God help me to understand oil.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
