          "import_seq": 48002,
          "journal_date": "2025-06-27",
          "ocr_text": "S- And to one he gave five talents, to another two, and to another one, to each, according to his own ability and immediately he went on a journey\n\nO- God knew each ones gifting and ability. My talents are based on what God feels I can steward well. If I compare what I have to someone else I could get envious or jealous if I feel I have less\n\nA- because they are utilizing me. Instead I should focus on what I have and increase my ability so God can entrust more to me so that I can multiply what I have to be a blessing to others.\n\nP- God help me to be faithful in what you have given me and to be generous with what I have.\n\n- Planning \u0026\nAHFDC \u0026 Dinner\nMeet Kate, Samala \u0026 Remi\n\nHousing F\n\nCopy R",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
