          "import_seq": 48000,
          "journal_date": "2025-06-25",
          "ocr_text": "S- Watch therefore for you know neither the day nor the hour in which the son of man is coming. Matt 25:18\n\nO- Jesus says this many times 'Watch'. It's hard to watch for an unexpected event. Like a watchman on the wall. Or looking for a thief.\n\nA- Watching requires looking for signs or any indication His time of return is drawing near. Watching allows me to have an urgency to be prepared. Preparation takes time. Atonement is near.\n\nP- God help me to be ready for when you come back. Help me to catch \u0026 pray. Work and keep. Be wise and faithful. \u0026 Generous.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212975634.jpeg",
