          "import_seq": 48001,
          "journal_date": "2025-06-26",
          "ocr_text": "S- For the kingdom of heaven is like a man travelling to a far country who called his own servants and delivered his goods to them. Matthew 25:14\n\nO- God! Faithful stewardship starts by understanding that everything I have is HIS and HE has just delivered it to us for a time.\n\nA- My TIME, TALENT, TREASURE is a result of the generosity, faith, and trust of my master and I will be held to account of how I handle these things.\n\nP- God thank you for my time, talent, treasure that you have given me. Help me not to neglect the gifts you have given to me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
