          "ocr_text": "S- And to one he gave five talents, to another two, and to another one, to each, according to his own ability and immediately he went on a journey. Matt 25:15\n\nO- God knew each one's gifting and ability. My talents are based on what God tests. I can steward well. If I compare what I have to someone else I could get envious or jealous if I feel I have less.\n\nA- because they are utilizing me. Instead I should focus on what I have and increase my ability so God can entrust more to me so that I can multiply what I have to be a blessing to others.\n\nP- God help me to be faithful in what you have given me and to be generous with what I have.\n\n- Planning \u0026\nAHFDC \u0026 Nanna\nMeet Kate, Somalis \u0026 Remi\nHousing F\nCopy R",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
