          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 49003,
          "journal_date": "2025-07-02",
          "ocr_text": "S- Then he will answer them saying \"Assuredly I say to you inasmuch as you did not do it to one of the least of these, you did not do it to me. And these will go away into everlasting punishment but the righteous into eternal life. Matt 25:46\n\nO- Jesus identifies with the poor in the same way we identify with our kids or spouse. When we give to the poor, we give to the Lord.\n\nA- The church should have a daily distribution to the poor. (Hungry,thirsty, sick, prisoner refugees, widows, orphans)\n\nP- God please help me to be a good steward of everything that you have given to me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212961727.jpeg",
