          "ocr_text": "S- For to everyone who has, more will be given out he will have abundance; but from him who does not have even what he has will be taken away. Matt 25:29\n\nO- Abundance comes to those who are faithful. Faithfulness involves increasing what we have through trading. Adding value → Muscle, Management, Mouth, Mind. (Time, Talent, Treasure)\n\nA- Spiritual stewardship = Wisdom Physical stewardship = Faithfulness Praise \u0026 Wisdom toward = Intimacy \u0026 Authority Blessed to be a blessing → give what Help Poor\n\nP- God help me to be wise/faithful/generous.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212975634.jpeg",
