          "ocr_text": "S- And the king will answer and say to them assuredly I say to you in as much as you did it to the least of these My brethren, you did it to Me. Matt 16:40\n\nO- God calls us to sell what we have to use what we have to make more. To take profits and give to the poor among us.\n\nA- I will understand markets, but sell to own oil and give profits to the poor.\n\nP- God help me to be wise, faithful and generous in all I do.",
