          "ocr_text": "S- therefore take the talent from him and give it to him who has ten talents.\n\nO- God is a risk manager. He takes from the poor performer and rewards the good performer.\n\nA- I need to have a good balance between the spiritual and the generous. Valuing relationships! productivity and generosity.\n\nP- God help me to live the extremes of all these things.",
