          "ocr_text": "S: And all the tithe of the land whether of the seed of the land or the fruit of the tree is the Lord. It is holy to the Lord. Numbers 27:30\n\nO: 10% of anything we make belongs to God. As we honor God by giving him what is His, He will abundantly bless us.\n\nA: I will tithe and believe God will rebuke the devourer for my sake.\n\nP: God thank you for blessing my life and thank you that although the enemy stole 5 million from me that you will restore to me 5x of what was stolen. Thank you for 25 million that will flow back into my hands.",
