          "ocr_text": "S- Command the children of Israel that they bring to you pure oil of pressed olives for the light to make the lamps burn continuously. Outside the veil of the testimony of meeting Aaron shall be in charge of it from evening until morning before the Lord continually. It shall be a statute forever in your generations Lev 24; 2-3\n\nO- Interesting that oil was required.\n\nA- Wise virgins had oil in their lamps. I need pure oil in mine.\n\nP- God help me to value and treasure the oil and anointing of your spirit on my life more than anything else.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212951350.jpeg",
