          "import_seq": 50002,
          "journal_date": "2025-07-05",
          "ocr_text": "S- Then you will cause the trumpet of Jubilee to sound on the 10th day of the seventh month on the day of atonement you shall make the trumpet to sound throughout all your land. \u0026 you shall rather sow nor reap what grows at its own accord nor gather grapes of your unleaded vines. Lev 25; 9,10\n\nO- Every 50yrs everything was forgiven. Physical \u0026 spiritual debt and all people were to rest.\n\nA- It is in rest that we find peace and rest that we trust in God. We rest but let others rest as well even our land.\n\nP- God help me to practice your principles for my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
