          "ocr_text": "S- Then you shall cause a trumpet of jubilee to sound on the tenth day of the seventh month on the day of atonement you shall make the trumpet sound throughout all your land. Lev 25; 1\n\nO- Interesting there is a trumpet sound that ends the feasts of trumpets and starts atonement.\n\nA- I will look for the return of the Lord and perfection of the saints. 50 x 40yrs\n\nP- God thank you that you have planned out my life. Help me to put you first in all things. Amen.",
