          "ocr_text": "S- Then I will command my blessing on you in the sixth year and it will bring forth produce enough for three years. Lev 25; 21\n\nO- The sabbath was very important to God. 6 yrs of work but the 7th is rest. A sabbatical. Could this be to show us an example of loops of rest for humanity in a millennium where we rest w/ God and enjoy His creation in an incomparable form?\n\nA- I believe there is a fulfillment of the day of atonement where God will redeem what He has purchased. And we will be perfected, sinless, spotless, immortal.\n\nP- God help me to surrender fully and completely to you.",
