          "journal_date": "2025-07-21",
          "ocr_text": "S- Now to Him who is able to do exceedingly abundantly above all we ask or think according to the power that works in us. Eph 3:20\nO- He can do more than we can ask or think. If we can think it, it's too small.\nA- If I stay close to Christ, He will always get me to think different. Much bigger. Bigger than smaller short term.\nP- God please help me to see and to go where you want for me and for your church. Help us to make disciples.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
