          "ocr_text": "S- Walk worthy of the calling with which you were called, with all lowliness, gentleness, with long suffering bearing with one another in love endeavoring to keep the unity of the Spirit in the bond of peace. Eph 4:1-3\nO- Worthy = unity, love, humility, patience.\nWe need to be harsh w/ ourselves and patient with others and not vice versa.\nA- I need to see the weakness in my life and the strengths in others to love the body and to be patient.\nP- God help me to be kind, patient, humble a servant to your body.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213040208.jpeg",
