          "ocr_text": "Day Steal\n\nS - Let him who stole steal no more but let him work with his hands what is good that he may have something to give to him who has need. Ep4:28\n\nO - From stealing to working to giving. God has called us out of a life style of taking into a lifestyle of giving/generosity.\n\nA - I am at the cusp of a life of crazy abundance. God is going to bless me so that I can be a blessing to others.\n\nP - God, help me to live to give. To find my purpose in loving you, serving others and up walking.",
