          "ocr_text": "Imitate Christ\n\nS - Be imitators of God as dear children. Awalk in Love as Christ has loved us and given himself for us an offering and a sacrifice to God for a sweet smelling aroma.\n\nO - We can be like children by imitating our heavenly father by living in the same way by sacrificing himself to God for us.\n\nA - I should look at Jesus like a child looks at their parent and imitate him by living to sacrifice to God who t am to serve others.\n\nP - God help me to be humble and imitate you by serving others. The way you served me.",
