          "ocr_text": "S - For this reason I bow my knees to the Father of our Lord Jesus Christ from whom the whole family in heaven and earth is named. Eph 3:11\n\nO - God has a family that is from Adam to Jesus' return. Both on earth and in heaven. And He will gather us one day and we will meet in the air.\n\nA - I should live for this day. Make all my decisions based on this day.\n\nP - God help me to have a vision of this day in my mind.\n\nRH Prayer\ndaring second spawn art bag clerk\nskill purse outdoor parade (dry) sean",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
