          "ocr_text": "Imitate Christ\n\nS - Be imitators of God as dear children. Awalk in Love as Christ has loved us and given himself for us an offering and a sacrifice to God for a sweet smelling aroma. Ep5:1,2\n\nO - We can be like children by imitating our heavenly father by living in the same way by sacrificing himself to God for us.\n\nA - I should look at Jesus like a child looks at their parent and imitate him by living to sacrifice to God who I am to serve others\n\nP - God, help me to be humble and imitate you by serving others. the way you served me",
