          "import_seq": 56000,
          "journal_date": "2025-07-27",
          "ocr_text": "S - That in the ages to come He might show the exceeding riches of His grace in His kindness toward us in Christ Jesus. Eph 2:27\n\nO - He raised us up in heavenly places together made us sit together in Christ Jesus. This scripture shows the spiritual dynamic of a corporate blessing of promotion, rest, rulership, relationship \u0026 revelation of what Christ has done\n\nA - I will do what I can to prioritize relationship with other believers knowing that resurrection, rest, relationship, rulership, \u0026 revelation awaits us. Not just now but forever in Christ.\n\nP - God help me to prioritize relationship with your people over everything.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213015728.jpeg",
