          "import_seq": 56001,
          "journal_date": "2025-07-28",
          "ocr_text": "S - 1. Individual call 2. Unity with gentiles, 3. Christ.\n4. Gifts to body. 5. Unity in family 6. Unity in Work 7. Spiritual warfare\n\nO - I wonder why Paul puts family last. And unity w/ gentiles first. I'm missing something.\n\nA - The Jews view of Gentiles was the priority to Paul. He knew that Christ priority was Jew \u0026 Gentile. Seems level of difficulty was the order. I must have peace with God, then race, then church, then family, then warfare.\n\nP - God help me to do the difficult things in all my relationships",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213015728.jpeg",
