          "import_seq": 56002,
          "journal_date": "2025-07-29",
          "ocr_text": "S - Nevertheless let each one of you in particular so love his own wife as himself; and let the wife see that she respects her husband. Eph 5:33\n\nO - Men want respect and women want love. When men feel disrespected they withhold love.\n\nA - I must always love my wife even if I feel disrespected.\n\nP - God help me to always love my wife no matter how I feel she treats me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213015728.jpeg",
