          "import_seq": 57000,
          "journal_date": "2025-07-31",
          "ocr_text": "S- See then that you walk circumspectly, not as fools but as wise, redeeming the time because the days are evil. Therefore do not be unwise but understand what the will of the Lord is. Eph 5:15-17\n\nO- We can be wise and know what God's will is. We can redeem time. We can make up for lost time.\n\nA- I need to give God the first part of my day and spend every min doing what He wants me to do.\n\nP- God help me to give priority to your presence and your Word.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213074270.jpeg",
