          "import_seq": 58003,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-07",
          "ocr_text": "S- Praying always with all prayer and supplication in the spirit being watchful to this end with all perseverance and supplication for all the saints. Ep 6:18\n\nO- Paul urges others to pray and intercede for the saints of God. We must see the power and the result of a prayerful life.\n\nA- I need to pray more for my family, for my staff, leadership and church.\n\nP- God, please forgive me for not praying enough. Please help me to be more disciplined in my prayer life for others and their walk with you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213059591.jpeg",
