          "ocr_text": "S - The kingdom of God is not eating and drinking but righteousness peace and joy in the Holy Ghost. Rom 14:17\nO - I want these three things. I don't care about the rules. I want righteousness peace and joy.\nA - I should keep my eyes set in Jesus. He is my righteousness gives peace and joy.\nP - God help me to keep my eyes focused on you.",
