          "import_seq": 61002,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-18",
          "ocr_text": "And let the lowly brother glory in his exaltation and the rich in his humiliation, because as a flower of the field he will pass away.\n\nO - There will be a flattening out \u0026 glory of man. All power and glory belongs to the Lord. Humbled will be exalted and exalted will be humbled. We are all God's creation\n\nA - I will treat others with dignity and respect as we are all brothers and the day will come where everyone throws their crowns down.\n\nP - God, please help me to live in a way that honors you and lifts up those who are down trodden.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213096719.jpeg",
