          "ocr_text": "S- Therefore lay aside all slothiness and overflow of wickedness and receive with meekness the implanted word which is able to save your souls. James 1:21\nO- the power of the Word is stronger than any type of sin or corruption.\nA- Salvation to sin is the Spirit and the word of God.\nP- God thank you for the Sword of the Spirit which is the Word of God.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
