          "ocr_text": "S- You will keep him in perfect peace whose mind is stayed on you because he trusts in you. Trust in the Lord forever for the Lord God is an everlasting Rock. Isaiah 26:3,4\n\nO- If my mind is stayed/set/fixed on Jesus I will remain in perfect peace because I will trust in God.\n\nA- My mind seems so fractured by so many things. I need time where I just stay focused on Jesus.\n\nP- God help me to be stayed on you. SET on you. Nothing matters except you in my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213134353.jpeg",
