          "import_seq": 57001,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-01",
          "ocr_text": "S- Be Filled with the Spirit speaking to one another in psalms and hymns \u0026 spiritual songs, singing and making melody in your heart to the Lord. Giving thanks, submitting... Eph 5:18-21\n\nO- Being filled w/ Spirit seems to be tied to worshiping through the day.\n\nA- I should listen to worship music more often, sing it in my life and be guided by it.\n\nP- God help me to live a lifestyle of surrender \u0026 worship.",
