          "journal_date": "2025-08-17",
          "ocr_text": "S - Life will lead us into storms.\n    We can do everything right → storms\n                          wrong → storms\n    Long storm + harder to last\n    Example -\n      Maybe your going through a storm\n      Jesus was watching → looking for faith\n      → We want them to do themselves\n    We stay small if we don't go through storms\n    Everyone wants a miracle but doesn't want a storm\n    Focus on Jesus \u0026 rise above the storm",
