          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 62003,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-23",
          "ocr_text": "S- And the scripture was fulfilled which says Abraham believed God and it was accounted unto him for righteousness. And he was called a friend of God. James 2:23\n\nO- When I act in faith it pleases God and friendship with God is possible through acting in faith.\n\nA- Faith who works is dead. When God tells me something action is required and a relationship with God is the result. If I want a real relationship with God then I must act on what I hear.\n\nP- God help me to be a doer of what you tell me. Guide me into a deeper relationship with you through action.",
