          "import_seq": 62001,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-21",
          "ocr_text": "S- Pure and undefiled religion before God and the Father is this: to visit orphans and widows in their trouble and to keep oneself unspotted from the world. James 1:27\n\nO- God's requirement is simple. To help the helpless and to keep myself unspotted from the world. The animals got spitted from what they looked at. I must keep my eyes focused on the right things.\n\nA- Catherine seems to be getting attacked on all sides. I need to keep her in prayer.\n\nP- God help Catherine and all the other orphans and widows safe and loved.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213085483.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213085483.jpeg"
