          "import_seq": 64003,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-05",
          "ocr_text": "S- Then a white robe was given to each of them and it was said to them that they should rest a little longer UNTIL both the number of their fellow servants AND their brethren who would be killed as they were was completed. Rev 6:11\n\nO- There is a number of martyrs that will complete the number of saints killed for their faith. Each martyr bring the return of Christ closer.\n\nA- My perspective of suffering is altered. Precious in the sight of the Lord is the death of His saints.\n\nP- God please help me to live in such a way that represents who you are.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213120583.jpeg",
