          "import_seq": 65001,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-05",
          "ocr_text": "S - If anyone is to be taken captive, to captivity he goes if anyone is to be slain with the sword with the sword must be slain. Here is a call for the endurance and faith of the saints. Rev 13:10\n\nO - This is the hour of darkness where authority is given to the enemy. This mirrors the garden of Gethsemane w/ Jesus.\n\nA - Not my will but thine be done must be my attitude when this time comes.\n\nP - God thank you that you love me and I pray that I would be able to stand in the day of tribulation to not deny you or my faith in the midst of persecution and trials.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213275234.jpeg",
