          "import_seq": 67002,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-12",
          "ocr_text": "S- And they cried with a loud voice saying how long o Lord holy and true will you judge and avenge our blood on those who dwell on the earth. Rev 6:16\n\nO- There was a loud voice going to God asking for justice. The cry went from Father forgive them to AVENGE OUR BLOOD\n\nA- There is intercession asking Christ to Return to Earth to AVENGE THE BLOOD and it gets louder withe each martyr that is added to the alter.\n\nP- God help me to call on you for mercy and help me to be one who lays my life down for that.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213172788.jpeg",
