          "import_seq": 59003,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-11",
          "ocr_text": "S- And my speech and my preaching were not with persuasive words of human wisdom but in demonstration of power and of the Spirit 1 Cor 2:4\n\nO- Paul showed the power of God more than just wisdom. The gospel includes Gods power.\n\nA- We need to share the power of God through healings, conversions, miracles, answers to prayer.\n\nP- God help me to live a life of devotion and prayer that results in miracles",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213048278.jpeg",
