          "import_seq": 63000,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-24",
          "ocr_text": "S- Even so the tongue is a little member and boasts great things. See how great a forest a little fire kindles. James 3:5\n\nO- The words that people say communicates ideas that can set things ablaze.\n\nA- I need to be vocal about things I'm doing and get people to talk about it until lifiting start to heat up.\n\nP- God please help me to turn my faces to you and things that matter in my life instead of meditating pain.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213134353.jpeg",
