        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:47:06.597397+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "9095c072-fdc8-4aa9-9de4-a0f3f280efdd",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 65002,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-06",
          "ocr_text": "S - Write this \"Blessed are the dead who die in the Lord from on. Blessed indeed, says the Spirit, that they may rest from their labors for their deeds follow them.\" Rev 14:13\n\nO - Death is a blessing in the day of tribulation. It is the end of our race. What does it mean that our deeds follow us?\n\nA - I should look as living for Christ as an invitation to die to myself and my flesh till the day that my spirit is united w/ Christ's before it is reunited with my body in an incorruptible form.\n\nP - Thank you for the promise of eternal life and the opportunity to lay my life down for you in the same way you laid your life down for me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213275234.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213275234.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Rev 14:13",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T01:47:06.55+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:47:16.073269+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "3a5011d4-7b6a-4a51-9bce-3791f14d7f8a",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 66000,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-06",
          "ocr_text": "S- And they cried with a loud voice saying 'How long O Lord holy and true until you judge and avenge our blood on those who dwell on the earth?' Rev 6:16\n\nO- There is a cry from under the altar in heaven into the ears of God, asking for his return to earth, to execute vengeance on the wicked. This prayer is very close to the throne of God, and the volume gets louder with every martyr added. It brings us closer to His return.\n\nA- I will live in a way that shows I have laid my life down for the cause of Christ. He died as a martyr in America. Was counted worthy to suffer. How can I do this?\n\nP- God help me to live a life that's like Christ.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213186526.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213186526.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Rev 6:16",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T01:47:15.992+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:47:21.897384+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "d21ee8f2-b188-40bd-991a-dfd9e124488a",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 67003,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-13",
          "ocr_text": "S- The a white robe was given to each of them and it was said to them that they should rest a little while longer until both the number of their fellow servants and their brethren who would be killed as they were was completed. Rev 6:11\n\nO- The number of martyrs needs to be completed. Just as Jesus was prophesied to die and go to lay down his life there is a number of people who are destined to lay down their life.\n\nA- I need to embrace the destiny of what you have me. Even if I'm not at a place to lay my life down, I've experienced the blood of the Lord. I can now get better at sharing the word of my testimony. That will set me up to lay my life down!\n\nP- God help me to lay my life down.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213172788.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213172788.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Rev 6:11",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T01:47:21.855+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:46:14.571852+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "102e546b-540b-4f83-af34-bb949bbe0a3a",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 60002,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-14",
          "ocr_text": "S - But speaking the truth in love may grow up in all things into him Who is Christ. From whom the whole body joined and knit together by what every joint supplies according to the effective working by which every part does its share causes growth of (the body) for the edifying it self in love, Eph 4:15,16\nO - Every joint has a part to play. To fit, join, grow supply, knit the body together. This happens by speaking truth. Growing in truth.\nA - I need to listen to the truth daily. Speak truth to others so playing my part. I have specific responsibility.\nP - God help me to hear \u0026 understand my part \u0026 fit well.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213108909.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213108909.jpeg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Eph 4:15,16",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T01:46:14.534+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:46:26.214574+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "2b22fc01-931f-4f50-83d4-c2f89cf63f6c",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 61003,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-19",
          "ocr_text": "S - For no sooner has the sun risen with a burning heat than it withers the grass its flowers fade falls and its beautiful appearance perishes. So the rich man also will fade away in his pursuits.\n\nO - No matter how cool a business is, it will be left to someone else. But there is a reward of resurrection to those who love Jesus and serve Him\n\nA - I want to love Jesus and serve Him w/ my whole heart and to be an example of someone who obeys w a pure heart.\n\nP - Lord so many things distract from me loving you with all my heart. Help me love you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
