          "ocr_text": "S- Pure and undefiled religion before God and the Father is this: to visit orphans and widows in their trouble and to keep oneself unspotted from the world. James 1:27\nO- God's requirement is simple. It is to help the helpless and to keep myself unspotted from the world. The animals got spitted from what they looked at. I must keep my eyes focused on the right things.\nA- Catherine seems to be getting attacked on all sides. I need to keep her in prayer.\nP- God help Catherine and all the other orphans and widows safe and loved.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
