          "import_seq": 64000,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-01",
          "ocr_text": "S- Pay careful attention to him and obey his voice. Do not rebel against him for he will not pardon your transgression for my name is in him. Ex 23:21\n\nO- Adam, Cain, Noah, Pharaoh, Abraham, Moses, Israel, Maturity, Rules, Relationship, Consequence, Wickedness\n\nA- Seems high relationship give smaller rules and smaller consequences. But low relationship equals more rules and more consequences. His spirit will write laws on our hearts. But a relationship with a disobedience will result in huge consequence. According to Hebrews.\n\nP- God help me to have the ultimate law of love written on my heart",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213120583.jpeg",
