          "import_seq": 62002,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-22",
          "ocr_text": "S- Listen my beloved brethren. Has God not chosen the poor of this world to be rich in faith and heirs of the kingdom which he promised to those who love him? James 2:5\nO- The poor understand things of the kingdom that the rich do not. \u0026 They can be rich in faith and things that are unseen\nA- I should esteem Phylis and Stanley and others with respect and honor.\nP- God help me to show love, honor and dignity to all people that you have created.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213085483.jpeg",
