          "import_seq": 64001,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-02",
          "ocr_text": "S- Then all the tax collectors and the sinners drew near to Him to hear him. Luke 15:1\n\nO- There was a spirit/heart of love that drew sinners to Jesus. Did Jesus not display the same heart of love to the pharisees? O: is it pride that draws Jesus away? We truly are all sinners. But \"sinners\" admit it and know they are. I do not.\n\nA- I am the worst of sinners because I act like a saint. I need to humble myself before God and ask him to forgive me everyday.\n\nP- God please help me to love you and to be humble.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213120583.jpeg",
