          "ocr_text": "S- Blessed and holy is he who has part in the first resurrection over such the second death has no power but they shall be the priest God and A Christ and shall reign with Him a thousand. Rev 20:6\n\nO- There is a 1st resurrection that will happen and it seems to me not everyone will be a part of it.\n\nA- It shows that these were the martyrs. Why is that taught. Radical left are taught to kill. Radical christ followers are taught to die.\n\nP- God help me to die everyday to myself.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
