          "import_seq": 67000,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-10",
          "ocr_text": "S- For God so loved the world that he gave his only son that whosoever believes in him should not perish but have everlasting life. John 3:16\n\nO- God loves everyone. This love was made shown in the life of Jesus. God's only son. It's not just love but a promise of eternal life that was demonstrated in the event of Resurrection that the world celebrates on Easter. That whoever believes would receive it.\n\nA- We can believe in Jesus. And live in a way that glorifies Him.\n\nP- God please help me to live for you in everything I do and say.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213172788.jpeg",
