          "import_seq": 67003,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-13",
          "ocr_text": "S- The a white robe was given to each of them and it was said to them that they should rest a little while longer until both the number of their fellow servants and their brethren who would be killed as they were was completed. Rev 6:11\n\nO- The number of martyrs needs to be completed. Just as Jesus was prophecied to die and sit to lay down his life there is a number of people who are destined to lay down their life.\n\nA- I need to embrace the destiny of what you have me. Even if I'm not at a place to lay my life down, I've experienced the blood of the Lamb. I can now get better at sharing the word of my testimony. That will set me up to lay my life down!\n\nP- God help me to lay my life down",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213172788.jpeg",
