          "import_seq": 63002,
          "journal_date": "2025-08-30",
          "ocr_text": "S- But the wisdom that is from above is first pure then peaceable, gentle, willing to yield, full of mercy and good fruits, without partiality, and without hypocrisy. Now the fruit of righteousness is sown in peace by those who make peace. James 3:17,18\n\nO- Jesus displayed wisdom from above. He didn't dominate. He came as a child and in peace. He calls us to follow him in the same spirit.\n\nA- All authority has been given to Christ. He calls me to operate in the same spirit. To have the same fruit.\n\nP- God help me to walk in your spirit and not the spirit of man.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213134353.jpeg",
