          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "cc4c6837-d186-4d10-bac2-e388ff17c74d",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 66002,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-08",
          "ocr_text": "S- Blessed and holy is he who has part in the first resurrection over such the second death has no power, but shall be the priest, God and Christ. Him a thousand, Rev 20:6\n\nO- There is a 1st resurrection that will happen and it seems to me not everyone will be a part of it.\n\nA- It shows that these were the martyrs. Why is this taught. Radical left are taught to kill. Radical christ followers are taught to die.\n\nP- God help me to die everyday to myself.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213186526.jpeg",
