          "import_seq": 64002,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-04",
          "ocr_text": "S- I say to you there is more joy in heaven over one sinner who repents than over ninety-nine just persons who need no repentance. Luke 15:7\n\nO- God's heart to see all people. Not just some like the saved. He wants everyone to come to know who He is.\n\nA- If (and I am) a child of God, I need to love the lost and have a passion for those who don't know Him.\n\nP- God give me a heart for the lost. The same heart of love that's willing to die to myself. Let it begin with my wife.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213120583.jpeg",
