          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 66000,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-06",
          "ocr_text": "S- And they cried with a loud voice saying 'How long O Lord holy and true until you judge and avenge our blood on those who dwell on the earth?' Rev 6:16\n\nO- There is a cry from under the altar in heaven into the ears of God, asking for his return to earth, to execute vengeance on the wicked. This prayer is very close to the throne of God, and the volume gets louder with every martyr added. It brings us closer to his return.\n\nA- I will live in a way that shows I have laid my life down for the cause of Christ. It died as a martyr in America. Was counted worthy to suffer. How can I do this?\n\nP- God help me to live a life that's like Christ.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213186526.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213186526.jpeg"
