          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 66003,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-09",
          "ocr_text": "S- And the armies in heaven clothed in fine linen white and clean followed him on white horses. Rev 19:15\n\nO- There were the martyrs in Rev 6 with white Robes who were asking for Christ to return. Was this them?\n\nA- I should not be hasty in answering that I am a saint that will be w Jesus' army. I need fear and trembling to give myself 100% to Jesus.\n\nP- God, help me to follow you wth my whole heart and life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213186526.jpeg",
