          "import_seq": 67001,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-11",
          "ocr_text": "S- When he opened the 5th seal I saw under the alter the souls of those who had been slain for the word of God and for the testimony which they held. Rev 6:9\n\nO- There are many people throughout history that have been killed by the state, others for sharing the truth. There is a spirit of hatred and murder.\n\nA- Understand that there is no rationalization of these who have embraced a murderous attest spirit. I cannot worry about explaining away hatred. Everyone has their choice to make.\n\nP- God please help me to have a fear of you. Not man. Not Death. Not Sickness",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213172788.jpeg",
