          "import_seq": 65003,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-07",
          "ocr_text": "S - Then one of the four living creatures gave to the seven bowls full of the wrath of God who lives forever and ever. Rev 15:7\n\nO - This is a scary picture of God's wrath being given to angels to execute His judgment against His enemies.\n\nA - I will meditate on the wrath of God as this Boy is approaching and getting closer as the return of Christ draws near.\n\nP - God please instill in me not only an appreciation of your love and grace but also your wrath and judgment.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213275234.jpeg",
