          "journal_date": "2025-09-07",
          "ocr_text": "S- For then there will be great tribulation such has not been seen since the beginning of this world until this time no nor shall ever be. Matt 24:21\n\nO- The great tribulation will happen after the abomination of desolation. Days will be shortened.\n\nA- As Jesus, his disciples, Charlie died there will be a great tribulation where power will be given to Pade filled w hatred.\n\nP- God please help me to love everyone like you did w a sacrificial love.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213186526.jpeg",
