        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:47:26.772421+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "6dab8665-bbb7-4517-a112-dd615087c914",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 67002,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-12",
          "ocr_text": "S- And they cried with a loud voice saying how long a Lord holy and true will thou judge and avenge our blood on them that dwell on the earth. Rev 6:16\n\nO- There was a loud voice going to God asking for justice. The cry went from Father forgive them to AVENGE OUR BLOOD\n\nA- There is intercession asking Christ to Return to Earth to AVENGE THE BLOOD and it gets louder with each martyr that is added to the altar.\n\nP- God help me to call on you for mercy and help me to be one who lays my life down for that.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213172788.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213172788.jpeg"
