        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:47:31.04399+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "60b77a9f-e992-4487-898b-2a8dab2a1b36",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 68000,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-14",
          "ocr_text": "S- And the armies in heaven clothed in fine linen, white and clean followed Him on white horses. Rev 19:13\n\nO- Those in chapter 6, the martyrs had the white robes, but now the hail white horses. This is the Revelation of Jesus and His bride. How much patience must God feel to listen to these voices and not act.\n\nA- If Jesus is waiting on executing judgment then I have no place to do it myself. If I want justice I must first lay my life down on this side of Heaven to ask for vengeance in the next. We must remain patient to suffer for His name to be counted worthy to as for God to avenge my blood.\n\nP- God help me to lay my life down and to serve others and to share the word of my testimony to others.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
