          "ocr_text": "S- Behold I am coming quickly! Blessed is he who keeps the words of the prophecy of this book. Rev 22:7\n\nO- Jesus' return is soon. I should do everything I can do to prepare for His return.\n\nA- In light of His return I should prepare for it by serving Christ and having integrity of heart and putting Christ first.\n\nP- I want to love you more said give my life to you more. Please increase my love for you. Gently pls.",
