          "import_seq": 69001,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-19",
          "ocr_text": "S- I knew that he will rise again in the resurrection at the last day. Jesus said to her, I am the resurrection and the life. He who believes in me, though he die he will live. And whosoever lives and believes in me will never die. Do you believe this? John 11:24-26\n\nO- There was a belief in a resurrection and a last day in Judaism. Why are we taught so much on eternal life but not about resurrection?\n\nA- Believing in resurrection to me is so much more exciting that eternity in heaven. God created us for earth. I need to live in the kingdom of God.\n\nP- God help me to love, serve obey you as king.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
