          "import_seq": 68003,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-17",
          "ocr_text": "S- And anyone not found in the book of life was thrown into the lake of fire. Rev 20:15\n\nO- Being written in the lambs book of life is the most important thing anyone can do.\n\nA- I want to be written in the Lambs book of life more than anything in this world. More than treasure or any other thing. What profits a man to gain the world and lose his soul?\n\nP- God help me to prioritize being written in your book more than anything else in life.\n\nS- But you have carefully followed my doctrine, manner of life, purpose, faith, long suffering, love, patience, afflictions, which happened to me in Antioch, at Iconium, at Lystra: what persecutions I endured. And out of them the Lord delivered me. Yes and all who desire to live a godly life in Christ Jesus will suffer persecution. 2 Tim: 10:12\nO- Follow doctrine → manner of life → purpose → faith → patience → love → consistency → afflictment → persecution.\nA- Seems that this follows the same pattern of Christ. He is the Word, lived, discipled others then died at the hand of sinners. Direct opposite of religion.\nP- God help me to love and to be consistent in my faith til death.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
