          "ocr_text": "S- And I heard another voice from heaven saying come out of her my people lest you share in her plagues and lest you receive of her plagues. For her sins have reached up to heaven and God remembered her iniquities. Rev 18:4-5\n\nO- Just like God called Israel out of Egypt, Moses out of Egypt, God calls us out of America. The culture of comfort, selfishness and indulgence. Cities provide refuge for a season, but they become a place of comfort for laziness and sin. Come out. Don't partake in the pleasure of sin. Ble there is a sharing in not just the sin, but the plagues that come with it.\n\nP- God please give me the wisdom and grace to be in the world but not of it. Amen",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213261208.jpeg",
