          "import_seq": 70000,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-22",
          "ocr_text": "S - I am he who lives and was dead and behold I am alive forevermore. Amen. And I have the keys of Hades and death.\n\nO - The greatest weapon the enemy has against me is death but Jesus has the keys of Hell and death. Even if someone can kill me Christ can give me life.\n\nA - knowing that Satan's power is limited I will not fear what man can do to me because my God is greater.\n\nP - God give me boldness to live for you and to be willing to lay down my life for others the way that you did.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213222337.jpeg",
