          "import_seq": 74001,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-17",
          "ocr_text": "S - But the cowardly, unbelieving, abominable, murderers, sexually immoral, sorcerers, idolaters, and all liars shall have their part in the lake which burns with fire and brimstone which is the second death. Rev 21:8\n\nO - These are the actions that lead to the second death. It's very clear here, who go to hell.\n\nA - I have been all these things in some in more ways. Some in less ways. But I have done all these sins. It's only through Jesus that I can be forgiven and delivered and set free from sin.\n\nP - God help my passion for you to overcome my desire for sin and selfishness.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213315660.jpeg",
