          "import_seq": 82003,
          "journal_date": "2025-11-15",
          "ocr_text": "S- For all have sinned and fallen short of the glory of God, being justified freely by His grace through the redemption that is in Christ Jesus. Rom 3:21-24\n\nO- Everyone has sinned and everyone can be redeemed to God through Christ.\n\nA- There is freedom and redemption in Christ Jesus and in Him alone.\n\nP- God help me to understand how to live in reciprocity to you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
