          "import_seq": 71002,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-08",
          "ocr_text": "Waipuna Chapel\n\u0026 Fires of Revival\n\nIntro - Encouragement -\n• Love Shawn a Jess - Apostal/hymnal W2 concert\n• Pastor to me.\n• Waipuna - Witness in: Cowd, Upcountry, Fives, kids, Hope Preschool, Mkowao Campus, Monthly Baptisms\n• Doubling in size.\n• Pain precedes Birth - (Natural \u0026 Spiritual)\n• Pain increases capacity to love - Brenne Brown\n  • Mothers love better   • Wyatt\n  • Leaders travail\n  • Widow's Lahaina Fire\n  • Jesus\n  • Pain",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
