        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:48:27.567139+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "b0efa04a-c63c-4c9d-807f-0258599f430f",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 73003,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-15",
          "ocr_text": "S - He who overcame shall inherit all things And I will be his God and he shall be my son. Rev 21\nO - There are only two outcomes. Overcoming and being overcome. It's an all or nothing wager. God is a God of extreme. Hot or Cold, Light or Darkness Good or Evil. Heaven or Hell. Satan owes the force.\nA - There are worthy opponents in this life to overcome. Doubt. Fear. Lust. Pride. God hasnt called me to mitigate sin but to irradicate it. Through Christ. As I get closer to Him, He will push the darkness out.\nP - Jesus draw me close to you. So close that your presence causes me to overcome all enemies of evil and the flesh in my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213328654.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213328654.jpeg"
          ],
