        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:48:37.641636+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "d30c674b-b0f2-4670-a997-58498eef4441",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 74000,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-16",
          "ocr_text": "S - And I heard a loud voice from heaven saying \"Behold the tabernacle of God is with men and he will dwell with them and they shall be his people. God Himself will be with them and be their God. Rev 21:3\n\nO - Feast of Tabernacles points to the end of when God will dwell with man again but in a way where we understand His complete provision.\n\nA - Reveals the wisdom and grace of God. I will rest knowing the God who knew we would rebel and plan that would allow us to be with Him forever.\n\nP - God struggle you that even when I fail, you have a plan to bring me back to yourself?",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213315660.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213315660.jpeg"
          ],
