          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T01:48:37.579+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:48:45.391461+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "c92add25-d712-48ae-8ed3-72ff62d06f91",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 74002,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-18",
          "ocr_text": "S - But there shall be nothing that defiles or causes an abomination or a lie, but those who are written in the lambs book of life. Rev 21:27\n\nO - Nothing will be allowed into heaven that is evil or a lie. Only what written in the laws book.\n\nA - There will only be righteousness in heaven. Everything that is evil wont be allowed into heaven.\n\nP - God, I am so unworthy to be called your son. I sometimes wish I could start my life over and do everything correctly. Help me not to be focused on the past, but on the future. Hope",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213315660.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213315660.jpeg"
          ],
