          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T01:48:45.35+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T01:49:05.026682+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "8ddc27c0-b8ed-4855-84ad-fdcaa97bf1bf",
          "import_batch_id": "b6b1042e-bed6-40e2-80f4-debdd9e59219",
          "import_seq": 76000,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-24",
          "ocr_text": "S- By this we know love because he laid down his life for us. And we also ought to lay down our lives for the brethren. But whoever has this world's goods and sees his brother in need and shuts up his heart from him how does the love of God abide in him? I John 3:16-17\n\nO- The objective of loving one another is through giving value. Time. Talent. Treasure. My focus should be on loving God through giving.\n\nA- I should make my main focus on how I can live to give \u0026 myself. More of my time talent \u0026 treasure. This starts with an inventory of what I have. Then who God wants me to give to.\n\nP- God help me to be a good steward of everything that you have given me to steward. You have given me much more than I deserve.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213368981.jpeg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213368981.jpeg"
          ],
