          "ocr_text": "S - Be watchful and strengthen the things that remain that are ready to die for I have not found your works perfect before God. Remember how you have received and heard, hold fast and repent. If you will not watch I will come upon you like a thief and you will not know what how I will come upon you.\n\nO - Strengthen things ready to die. Works need to be perfect before God. Watch and pray.\n\nA - I need to watch for His return and not get lazy in my passion and zeal for Jesus.\n\nP - God please help me to love you more and serve those you love.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213222337.jpeg",
