          "import_seq": 70003,
          "journal_date": "2025-09-25",
          "ocr_text": "S - Man devises his Path, God establishes his steps. God ordains steps.\n\nO - God deserves my/All glory honor and power from me because He made me His treasure.\n\nA - I will give Him glory through my tithe and taking care of His House, honor by giving my time, power by giving him my will.\n\nP - God yet thank you for giving me these talents treasure. Help me to honor you in giving it back to you.\n\nS - But the rest of mankind who were not killed by these plagues did not repent of the work of their hands that they should not worship demons and idols of gold and silver brass stone wood which can neither see nor hear nor walk. And they did not repent of their murder sorceries or their sexual immorality or their thefts. Rv\nO - Wickedness, hardness of heart, heart like flint is caused by pride. Similar to the 16 plagues of Egypt. Wickedness doesn't compromise or relent.\nA - Don't try to understand, compromise or make peace with evil. Evil doesn't change, soften, reason or compromise. Just live in a way that pleases God.\nP - God help me to live wise as serpents \u0026 harmless Septtd, living to please you and no one else.\nO - Then when I took the little book out of the angels hand and ate it and it was sweet as honey in my mouth but when I had eaten it my stomach became bitter. Rev 10:10\nO - There is a time for prophecy to be understood. The end time prophecy is immediately awesome to understand but painful in fulfillment\nA - I must be mentally and spiritually prepared for suffering. The prophetic is never welcomed by the world.\nP - God help me to be faithful to the prophetic insight you give to me. Help me not to remain silent but to speak the things you have slain to me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
