          "ocr_text": "S - And behold I am coming quickly and my reward is with me to give to everyone according to his work. Rev 22:12\n\nO - We are not saved BY our works but FOR good works that HE has prepared for us to work in. We will be judge by how we walked in them.\n\nA - I will not fall into the \"sloppy grace\" mindset but will also not fall into legalism. God saved me for good works that I must be faithful to walk in.\n\nP - God thank you for saving me. Help me to be faithful in all that you have saved me for. Help me not to burn out or to be lazy. Help me to be in love.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213315660.jpeg",
