          "ocr_text": "S- If we say that we have no sin we deceive ourselves and the truth is not in us. If we confess our sins He is faithful and just to forgive us our sins and to cleanse us from all unrighteousness.\n\nO- Confession is a part of walking in the light. If I confess my sin, He will forgive and cleanse me of all unrighteousness.\n\nA- I need to have a D group that I am honest and transparent with my sins.\n\nP- God please forgive me of my pride and lack of honesty with you and others about my struggles. Help me to live and think purely.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
