          "ocr_text": "S- Do not be deceived, God is not mocked. For whatever a man sows that he will also reap. For he who sows to the flesh will reap corruption but he who sows to the Spirit will of the Spirit reap everlasting life.\n\nO- Sowing to the flesh will have a result. So will sowing to the Spirit. The lust of the eyes, lust of the body, lust of power status. Sowing to the Spirit is prayer. Fasting the Word. Praying in the Spirit. I must have a result.\n\nA- I must sow to the Spirit. Sow time in worship, prayer, tongue, in the word. It will have a result.\n\nP- God give me grace to feed my spirit more than my flesh.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
