          "ocr_text": "S - It shall be imputed to us who believe in Him who raised up Jesus our Lord from the dead, who was delivered up because of our offenses and was raised up for our justification. Rom 4:24,25\n\nO - Jesus was raised because we have been justified. Through the death our sins have been forgiven and we are justified through His resurrection.\n\nA - I must live in the confidence that all my sins, past present, and future have been forgiven and His resurrection pointed to my justification\n\nP - God thank you for forgiving and justifying me to your father!",
