          "ocr_text": "S- Behold I am coming as a thief. Blessed is he who watches and keeps his garments lest he walk naked and see his shame. Rev 16:15\n\nO- All these bowls of wrath were poured out and the hardness of man was so great that judgment didn't change their minds or hearts.\n\nA- I hope that every discipline that God gives to me makes my heart softer and more teachable and humble to God. Punishment/Discipline can make people repent or rebel depending on the condition of the heart.\n\nP- God, please continue to give me grace, help me to love you more. I pleaty or in lack, let me love you more.",
