          "import_seq": 72003,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-11",
          "ocr_text": "S - Then a voice came from the throne saying Praise our God all you his servants and those who bear him both small and great. Rev 19:15\n\nO - Status means nothing on the day Jesus returns to judge the living and dead. What matters is that we fear the Lord and live in a way that glorifies Him.\n\nA - I will meditate on His return and live my life in a way that shows I not only love Jesus but also have a reverant fear and awe of Him.\n\nP - Thank you Jesus for loving me and revealing yourself to me. Help me to honor, respect and fear you in all I do.\n\nS - But the rest of the dead did not live again until the thousand years were finished. This is the first resurrection. Blessed and Holy is he that hath part in the first resurrection. Over such the second death has no power but they shall be priests of God and of Christ and shall reign with Him 1000 yrs.\n\nO - There will be a select group. Those behaved in their faith/others to Jesus, who didn't worship the beast, his image, or have his mark.\n\nA - There is a special privilege to those who die for their testimony and are not subject to the world system.\n\nP - God, I don't need to be a part of the 1000 reign but help me to share my testimony of how you saved me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
