          "journal_date": "2025-10-13",
          "ocr_text": "S - Now when the thousand years have expired, satan will be released from his prison and will go out to deceive the nations of the earth which are in the four corners, Gog \u0026 Magog to gather them together to battle, where number is as the sand of the sea.\n\nO - This seems discouraging that even after the 1000yr reign will have seed in the number of the sands that are deceived, gathered and destroyed.\n\nA - God, help me to serve you in a way that purifies me and my legacy. If I surrender my will to you. Help me to live and love you with my whole.\n\nP - There is not much I can do to control heart whether or not I or my descendants are chosen by God to inhabit His kingdom. He choses the purges. He decides. And He is good. I can trust Him",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
