          "import_seq": 74002,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-18",
          "ocr_text": "S - But there shall be nothing that defiles or causes an abomination or a lie, but only those who are written in the lambs book of life. Rev 21:27\n\nO - Nothing will be allowed into heaven that is evil or a lie. Only what written in the laws book.\n\nA - There will only be righteousness in heaven. Everything that is evil won't be allowed into heaven.\n\nP - God, I am so unworthy to be called your son. I sometimes wish I could start my life over and do everything correctly. Help me not to be focused on the past, but on the future. Hope",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
