          "ocr_text": "Waipuna Chapel\n\u0026 Fires of Revival\n\nIntro - Encouragement -\n· Love Shawn a Jess - Apostolic/Kvanual U2 concert\n· Pastor to me.\n· Waipuna - Witness in Coody, Up country Fires, kids Hope Preschool, Mckawa Campus, Monthly Baptisms\n· Doubling in size.\n\n· Fain precedes Birth - (Natural \u0026 Spiritual)\n· Pain increase capacity to love - Brreme Brown\n· Mothers love better · Wyatt\n· Leaders travail\n· Widow + Lahaina Fire\n· Jesus\n· Pain",
