          "import_seq": 72001,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-09",
          "ocr_text": "S- The ten horns which you saw are ten kings who have received no kingdom as yet but they receive authority as one have as kings w/ the beast. These are of one mind and they will give their power and authority to the beast. Rev 17:12,13\n\nO- The ten horns could be CEOs not actual kings. Having I mind could be AI. Why would they hate the harlot?\n\nA- These thing seem confusing to me right now. I'll put them on the shelf til the Holy Spirit reveals these thing.\n\nP- God please help me to understand your plan for your return.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213261208.jpeg",
