          "import_seq": 73002,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-14",
          "ocr_text": "S - And anyone not found written in the Book of Life was cast into the Lake of Fire. Rev 20:15\n\nO - There is a book that has names in it that lived for Christ and love Christ. This book can have names deleted. Down in according to Rev 3:5.\n\nA - Is white garment or white out. Strengthen what remains. Hold fast. Repent.\n\nP - God help me to abide, to love you from a heart of gratitude and remembrance. You call me to remember and recall your goodness kindness and mercy. It is so easy to get complacent and take for granted. Forgive me and give me grace to pursue you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213328654.jpeg",
