          "import_seq": 75003,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-23",
          "ocr_text": "S- But whoever keeps his word truly, the love of God is perfected in him. By this we know that we are in Him. I John 2:5\n\nO- The love of God can be perfected in our lives and manifest in us obeying His word. This is evidence we are abiding in Him. If we abide we will bear much fruit.\n\nA- God I must meditate on the Love of Christ and allow His love to work in my life til I begin to obey his commands.\n\nP- God thank you for your love that covers everything in my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213303688.jpeg",
