          "ocr_text": "S- If my people who are called by my name will humble themselves and pray and seek my face and turn from their wicked ways, I will hear from heaven, forgive their sins and heal their land. II Chron 7:14\n\nO- Humility → prayer → seeking Face → Turn from sin. Repentance starts w/ humility z prayer. It will then lead to seeking God's face/favor/blessing, this will cause us to turn from sin.\n\nA- I must humble myself. Begin to pray. Have a disciplined prayer life. Then seek God's face. Turning from sin starts by turning to God in humility\n\nP- God I can't do life without you. I cannot live righteously without you. I need you to show me the way of escape and to give me courage to obey.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213431314.jpeg",
