          "import_seq": 84001,
          "journal_date": "2025-11-21",
          "ocr_text": "S - But God demonstrates His love toward us in that while we were still sinners Christ died for us. Rom 5:6-8\n\nO - God loves us not because we deserve it, but because He chooses to reveal his unconditional love for us.\n\nA - I should not take advantage of this love but lean into it and be grateful for his love for me.\n\nP - God, so many times I fail to seek you and humble myself because of my love for sin. Help me to fight. Help me to overcome",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213479174.jpeg",
