          "ocr_text": "S- That he who received the 5 talents went and traded with them and made 5 talents more. Therefore take the talent from him and give it to him and cast the one who has more will be given and he will have abundance but one who has none even what he has will be given away. Matt 25:24,16\nO- One was traded lost what they had. Every loss informs false risks.\nA- I need careful inventory of what I have and have. I have time. I have talents. I have multiplied what it have. I have peace paul Trust. You. I need your hand to work and againes a wall and Life. The need a miracle.\n\nS - Matthew is the ancestor of David. Tamar slept with her father-in-law and had a baby (Judah). Rahab was a prostitute. David was an adulterer and murderer.\n\nO - IE patriarchs in Israel could be used by God and He is long suffering and kind - still use us.\n\nA - I must strive against sin knowing that God is to forgive me when I fall.\n\nP - God thank you that you are my father and that I love and follow Jesus. Help me to be like Him and to love the lost.\n\nDec 19\nS - Other? unusually I say to you in as much as you did not do one of the least of these you did not do it to me. Matt 25:31-46\n\nO - I have only a minister to the poor. To how to make and organize my finances. I appreciate being with it not giving what is owed to me.\n\nP - God please help me to harness you in all giving. Help me to put you first in everything.",
