          "ocr_text": "Couple Retreat\n\n1. Made in God's image (male \u0026 female) - Alignment\n2. Roles \u0026 Goals - Thinker + Feeler - HD\n3. Love Languages - Speak another language\n4. University of Selflessness\n5. Love \u0026 Respect\n6. Solving Conflict\n   • Know seasons \u0026 make rules\n   • No emotional decisions\n   • Write out argument when big\n   • Have counsel. Be under Authority.\n   • Give time for others to spend time w/ God.\n   • Don't speak when mad.\n7. Parenting\n   • Dead Right in front of children\n   • Dad: Respect \u0026 honor when other parent is absent\n   • Sit in front\n   • Shepherd the heart\n   • No sleeping in bed\n   • Sleep 2 eat schedule",
