          "ocr_text": "S- And it shall come to pass in that day that the remnant of Israel And such as have escaped of the house of Jacob will never again depend on him who defeated them. But will depend on the Lord, the Holy One of Israel in truth. Isaiah 10:20\n\nO- God's heart has always been that His people would follow him and depend on Him. It doesn't matter if they are free or under oppression. He just wants his people to come to Him.\n\nA- I will come to God no matter who is in power of our government. God is in control no matter what and He doesn't care who is writing laws as long as I allow Him to write his laws on my heart.\n\nP- God help me to live in your kingdom with you sitting on the throne of my heart.",
