          "ocr_text": "S- It shall come to pass in that day that his burden will be taken away from your shoulders And his yoke from your neck and the yoke will be destroyed because of the anointing oil.\n\nO- Christ is the anointed one. He broke the yoke. He overcame death and gave freedom to his people.\n\nA- It doesn't matter where we live, what government is in control. All authority has been given to Jesus. We need to go and make disciples.\n\nP- God, help me to be faithful in making disciples no matter where I am.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
