          "journal_date": "2024-01-04",
          "ocr_text": "Jan 4 - Widow challenge\nFrom 1- Tide goes out and you can find treasures\nBut there is a Widow. The tide will come back in. Opportunity will be lost\nProv 2- Pursue wisdom like a women you're in love with.\nJesus is lady wisdom. Pursue Jesus.\nJames is like Proverbs NT.\n7 pillars in James 3.\nSkill given from heaven. Sophia- wisdom from above\nIntimacy opens up secrets.\nProv 7- to reign in life.\nWisdom- Skill = Action- Jesus\n#1- Wisdom- Woman\n      Harlot- woman\nThe greatest commodity is wisdom\nwho\nTrick are times where we intertwine with\nGod so our hearts are ready for promotion.\n\"mysteries of God, Timing matters\"\nWaiting on God is NEVER wasted.\nJan 5\nS- All things are possible !! All things work together\nO- God doesn't think from overwhelm. He only\nsees possibilities !! WOW!\nART OF THINKING BRILLIANTLY!\nDon't live toward kingdom. Live FROM kingdom\nPractice Peace. Peace is antidote to worry.\nPractice makes Permanent. If your heart\nis FIXED your mind can be SET.\nA- I need to practice to make permanent\nP- God help me to see possibilities",
