          "import_seq": 1001,
          "journal_date": "2024-01-06",
          "ocr_text": "Jan 6\nS- The Spirit of the Lord will rest upon Him.\nThe spirit of wisdom and understanding. The Spirit\nof counsel and might. The Spirit of knowledge\nand of fear of the Lord. Isaiah 11:2.\nO- The Spirit gives wisdom, understanding, council and\nmight, knowledge and Fear of God. As the Spirit\nRESTS on something.\nA- And if someone the Spirit of God can rest on)\nCan fire consume this thing? Is it the\nbest? 1st is best. Best part of Finance. First in my heart.\nP- God let me be someone you can rest on.\nJan 7\nS- And in that day you will say \"O Lord I will praise\nYou. Then you were angry with me, your anger\nis turned away and you comfort me. Behold\nGod is my salvation I will trust and not\nbe afraid. For Yah, the Lord is my strength\nand song. He also has become my salvation\n0- God doesn't stay angry but comforts us. Is 12:1-2\nJesus took away all wrath and the Holy Spirit\nis our comforter. I must know the Spirit.\nI must be filled w/ the Spirit of God.\nA- Holy Spirit, please fill me. Help me to\noperate in the overflow of your spirit.\nP- God, I need you. I surrender to\nyour Spirit today. Work in and through\nme to reach your harvest!",
