          "import_seq": 2000,
          "journal_date": "2024-01-08",
          "ocr_text": "S- Behold it is Solomons couch with sixty valiant men around it, of the valiant men of Israel. They all hold swords. Being expert in war, every man has a sword on his thigh ble \u0026 fear in the night. SOS 3:1-8\n\nO- This is not the Song of Solomon but the Song of the Shulamite. She declares her love for the shepherd. Not the king. The king represents wisdom, money, power. Shepherd represents love.\n\nA- The world tries to win her love but cannot. She is devoted to the shepherd. She wants others to know it is love. No one understand. They think she is crazy. They all want the love of Solomon. She has it. But she doesn't want it. She just wants the shepherd.\n\nP- Lord I love you. I want to love you more. Give me the grace to love you more than anything else that this world has to offer.",
