          "ocr_text": "S- But he who is greatest among you shall be your servant and whoever exalts himself will be humbled. And he who humbles himself will be exalted. Mt 23:11\n\nO- It's not our place to promote ourselves. Promotion comes from the Lord. We shall be humble and serve others. God will promote.\n\nA- I will not brag to others or try to promote myself. I will serve and leave promotion to God.\n\nP- God thank you that you love me and have good in store for me. Help me to serve others the way you did.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218408485.jpg",
