          "ocr_text": "S - The hand of the diligent will rule. But the lazy man will be put to forced labor. Prov 12:24 O - Everyone will work. The diligent work of their own choosing. The lazy are forced by the diligent. A - If you don't want to be told what to do do it yourself. If you want to be the boss work more than every one else. P - Help me to be diligent.",
