          "import_seq": 12002,
          "journal_date": "2024-02-21",
          "ocr_text": "S- Whoever shuts his ears to the cry of the poor will also cry himself and not be heard Pro 21:15\n\nO- There is a law of sowing \u0026 reaping in actions. To help others when they need it to ignore others, it will be ignored.\n\nA- I will continue to sow good will into the life of people around me. Knowing God is watching and my provider\n\nP- God, help me to be a blessing to: Madlyne, Henry, Lance, Zach, Billy \u0026 Naomi",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
