          "import_seq": 14000,
          "journal_date": "2024-02-29",
          "ocr_text": "S- Do not boast about tomorrow, for you do not know what a day may bring forth. Prov 20:1\n\nO- There is a difference in boasting and planning. We are to make plans, but be humble knowing God is the one who allows some plans to succeed and others to fail.\n\nA- God, you have been so gracious to me. Even in my failures, you have made me successful. Give this day and help me to know what that's all will being but I know who holds the year.\n\nP- I surrender my plans into your hands.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218411985.jpg",
