          "import_seq": 16000,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-08",
          "ocr_text": "S- So Hezekiah said to Isaiah, \"The word of the Lord which you have spoken is good\" for he said, \"At least there will be peace and truth in my day.\"\nO- Unexpected response. Hezekiah, who fasted and prayed for an extension of his life displayed care about his sons or the nation. He was the last king. One who didn't care about legacy. Different from Jesus, who sacrificed himself for a legacy. Jesus will be forever king of Israel. There will be no king of Israel, because Jesus is king.\nA- I should model myself after the current king. One who gives his life for the life of people in his kingdom. My life is less important than theirs.\nP- God help us to love others and the next generation with a sacrificial love.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218412486.jpg",
