          "ocr_text": "S- But he answered \"It is written 'Man shall not live by bread alone, but by every word that comes from the mouth of God\". Matthew 4:4\nO- God has sustenance for me that's more important than natural food. My flesh wants bread. But my spirit longs for the Words of God. How can I feed my spirit and fulfill the deepest longings of my heart\nA- I need to spend more time in the Word and in prayer. I want to hear God for ME, for my FAMILY, for my CHURCH.\nP- God, open my heart.",
