          "journal_date": "2024-02-22",
          "ocr_text": "S- Do you see a man who excels in his work? He will stand before kings. He will not stand before unknown men. Prov 22:29\n\nO- If someone does something well it will bring people of influence into his sphere. Excellence and growth are attractive. Even to kings.\n\nA- If I just EXCEL in what I do, it will automatically attract others. I need a plan and create that plan.\n\nP- God, help me to be Excellent \u0026 to EXCEL in everything that I do.",
