          "ocr_text": "S- A highway of holiness shall be there. The unclean shall not pass over it. But it shall be for others. Wayfares walks the road, although a fool shall not go along. Is 35:8\n\nO- There is a day coming where it will be easier to do good than evil.\n\nA- As I get closer to God it becomes easier to see flaws in both myself and others. It's easier to get discouraged. I need to remind myself of this highway.\n\nP- God help me to see your plan in all of this.",
