          "ocr_text": "S- He will feed his flock like a shepherd he will gather the lambs with his arm and carry them in his bosom and gently lead those who are with young. Isaiah 40:11\nO- Jesus feeds, gathers, carries, leads his flock. Feeds for strength, gathers when scattered, carries when injured or hurting, leads when directionless.\nA- A good shepherd can do all these things. Feed- Establish, Engage- gather, Equip- Feed, Empower- Lead\nP- God help us to make disciples.\nCommit, serve, give",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
