          "ocr_text": "S - Behold the former things have come to pass and new things I declare. Before they spring forth I will tell you of them. I swish 43:7\n\nO - God will bring back good things and add better things to them. God works in cycles but the macro trend is up. He is establishing righteousness.\n\nA - I will trust that justice will prevail and do what I can to love those within the household of faith.\n\nP - God, please give me eyes to see what you love, and how to participate in what you are doing.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
