          "ocr_text": "S - Praise and lifecare in the power of the tongue and those who loved it will eat its (fruit). Prov 21\nO - We love either life or death. We gravitate toward what we love. What we listen to shows what we love. Guarding the heart is a positive or negative feedback loop.\nA - I should look at my heart as the most important thing to push me in the right direction. What does God want for me? How do I get there? Who do I need to listen to? Who do I need to stop listening to? What I hear will dictate what I see.\nP - God help me to guard my heart.",
