          "ocr_text": "S - It is the glory of God to conceal a matter but the glory of kings to seek it out. Prov 25:12\nO - No evil value comes easy. Especially com God. Hard to see I should hard.\nA - I must know the difference between a lover and a hater\nP - Please give me wisdom between free and hiding glory.",
