          "ocr_text": "S - Fear not for I am with you. Be not dismayed for I am your God. I will strengthen you. Yes I will help you. I will uphold you with my righteous hand. Isaiah 41:10\n\nO - He is with me. He's my God. Strength, help, support. It is given by Him.\n\nA - I should not fear aging. God is with me.\n\nP - God help me to age w/ grace.",
