          "import_seq": 13001,
          "journal_date": "2024-02-24",
          "ocr_text": "S - Through wisdom a house is built.\n   By understanding it is established\n   By knowledge the rooms are filled\n   with all precious + pleasant riches. Prov 24:3-4\nO - Wisdom is the core foundation of everything - why ?\n   Understanding is the structure - What ?\n   Knowledge is the details - How ?\nA - A team must know what,\n      what,\n      How.\nP - God help me to be a person of wisdom, knowledge and understanding.",
