          "ocr_text": "S - For I will pour water on him Who is thirsty and floods on the dry ground. I will pour my spirit on your descendants. And my blessing on your offspring. Is 44:3\nO - God will bless. Even if I'm dry. Thirsty. In bondage, he will rescue me.\nA - I need to hold on and hope in salvation that is coming.\nP - God I can't do this without you. Help me to trust/surrender repent. To you 100%.",
