          "import_seq": 6002,
          "journal_date": "2024-01-01",
          "ocr_text": "S - I should study the Word more. S - I should pray more. O - STAND firm, Cudgeled forward. I need to keep going. I need to keep pushing. I need to keep seeking Him. I need to keep knocking. I need to keep asking. I need to keep serving. I need to keep loving. I need to keep believing. I need to keep trusting. I need to keep hoping. I need to keep praying. I need to keep reading. I need to keep growing. I need to keep learning. I need to keep changing. I need to keep becoming who God wants me to be.\n\nFor the first time in my life, I think I understand what it means to be called a child of God. I've always known it intellectually, but today it became real to me. I can feel His love \u0026 His presence so deeply. I never thought that I would experience such a profound sense of belonging. God has chosen me. He calls me His own. I was loved before I could love Him back.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218409879.jpg",
