          "ocr_text": "S - He who mocks the poor reproaches his Maker and He who is glad at calamity will not go unpunished. Prov 17:5\nO - All people were created by God loves all that He created and blood take kindly to people who mock His creation based on what they own.\nA - I will look at all people equally. I wont regard that they have, their mental or physical capacity.\nP - God help me to see all people from your perspective.",
