          "ocr_text": "S - If you faint in the day of adversity your strength is small. Pov 24:10\nO - It's not wise to call out adversity. I can always accomplish more with less adversity.\nA - Work on strength, but also work on alliances\nP - God please strengthen me in areas where I'm weak.",
