          "journal_date": "2024-03-17",
          "ocr_text": "S - I am the Lord and there is no other. I bring the light and create the darkness. I make peace and create calamity. I the Lord, do all these things. Isaiah 46:7\nO - God allows all things to happen to test the heart of man. He is good.\nA - I will trust the Lord. I will hope in Him. He alone has all power. He alone is my rock.\nP - God, thank you that I can trust in you. Even in my weakness. Even in my disease. My sickness. My aging. My lack of self control. You are there.",
