          "ocr_text": "S- Apart from the mouth of the righteous is a mountain of life but the wicked it hides violence. Proverbs 10:11\nO- Listening to a righteous person speak should bring life to the hearer. The wicked is the opposite.\nA- I should strive to hear the voice of the righteous and be that voice to others.\nP- Lord let me be a voice of hope to those who are hurting.",
