          "ocr_text": "S - The heart of the righteous studies how to answer, but the mouth of the wicked pours forth evil. Prov 15:24\nO - Its not natural to know how to answer difficult questions. It takes study.\nI - I take intentionality.\nA - I will continue to learn to speak clearly for a traditional family. For 2 genders given to us at birth. For the existence, power \u0026 authority of God.\nP - God please help me to share your word wherever you give me a platform.",
