          "ocr_text": "S - Buy the truth and do not sell it. Also wisdom, instruction and understanding. Prov. 23:23\nO - The smart invest in the best. Get TRUTH WISDOM INSTRUCTION UNDERSTANDING\nA - The best investment is to invest in myself. I am good soil.\nP - God thank you, you made me good soil.",
