          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 14003,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-03",
          "ocr_text": "S- Then one of the twelve called Judas Iscariot went to the chief priest and said, \"what are you willing to give me if I deliver him to you?\" And they said, count out to him thirty pieces of silver. So from that time he sought opportunity to betray him. Matt 26:14\n\nO- Woman gave her treasure to Jesus. Judas took 30 pcs of silver to give Jesus away. Human trafficking. Noraham 9 Sodom vs Salem. Joseph sold into slavery. But Judah repented.\n\nA- Do I give money to people or trade people for money. I must keep the order right. Money should serve people not use versa.\n\nP- God please give me a generous heart.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218411985.jpg",
