          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 18001,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-15",
          "ocr_text": "S - You have bought me no sweet cane with money. Nor have you satisfied me with the fat of your sacrifices. But you have burdened Me with your sins. You have wearied me with your iniquities.\nO - Haven't sacrificed to God. Haven't given Him. It's 43:24 the best. Also have turned away and sinned. Missed the mark. Turned away to do something else.\nA - My offering must be the best. 100%. Firstfruits. Offering above. Give God the best.\nP - God forgive me for not putting you first in my time and attention.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218413362.jpg",
