          "import_seq": 10001,
          "journal_date": "2024-02-10",
          "ocr_text": "S - But a generous man devises generous things and by generosity he shall stand. Isaiah32:8 O - Generosity is something that someone can stand on. It's not something that takes away from you. It's something that gives you trust. A - Give generously, for are receiving trust in return. Trust is the most valuable commodity. Once trust is betrayed, it's nearly impossible to win back.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218411213.jpg",
