          "ocr_text": "S - Like a madman who throws fire brands, arrows and death,\n   Is the man who deceives his neighbor and says I was only joking. Prov 26:18-19\nO - Anytime I decide someone is a joke lost a hurtful thing. Humor if fine. Deceitfulness is not.\nA - I must be careful of my words.\nP - God help me to take my words with more gravitas.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
