          "import_seq": 15002,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-06",
          "ocr_text": "S - Remember now O Lord, I pray how I have walked before you in truth and with a loyal heart and have done what is good in your sight. And hezekiah wept bitterly. Isaiah 38:3\n\nO - Hezekiah brought his case before God didn't laying up his sin.\n\nA - Every man has sin. But I should not focus on my guilt and sin. I should focus on my righteousness I have in Christ.\n\nP - God please remember my righteousness through Christ. That I have been baptized into you Help me to walk in newness of life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218412410.jpg",
