          "import_seq": 17002,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-10",
          "ocr_text": "S - Fear not you worm Jacob. You men of Israel. I will help you says the Lord. And your redeemer the Holy one of Israel Isaiah 41:9\n\nO - God calls me a worm but loves me anyway.\n\nA - Baby humble is recognizing the true state of where I am.\n\nP - God thank you for loving a worm like me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
