          "import_seq": 11000,
          "journal_date": "2024-02-14",
          "ocr_text": "S - The soul of a lazy man desires and has nothing. But the soul of the diligent shall be made rich. Prov 13:4.\nO - Lazy people are nothing. Diluted people rule.\nA - I need consistency in my life.\nP - Help ME!!",
