          "import_seq": 14002,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-02",
          "ocr_text": "S- THEN the angel of the Lord went out and killed in the camp of the Assyrians 185,000 and when people arose early in the morning, there were corpses all dead. Is 37:36\n\nO- The prophet spoke. Then God acted. God allows us to speak HIS word. When we speak HIS word, HE causes it to come to pass. HIS word is alive.\n\nA- It's important that the words we speak are the word of God. When I speak HIS word, he will be faithful to answer.\n\nP- God, please help me to hear you clearly of what you want me to do.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
