          "import_seq": 15003,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-07",
          "ocr_text": "S - Indeed it was better for my own peace that I had great bitterness. But you have lovingly delivered my soul from the pit of corruption. For you cast all my sins behind your back. Is. 38:17\n\nO - He was brave to make a case for his righteousness even though he knew he was sinful and God responded with kindness.\n\nA - I will focus on doing my best but not looking at just sin/weakness, but righteousness/strength as well.\n\nP - God help me to focus on the good that exist instead of only what I could improve on.",
