          "ocr_text": "S - He will not fail nor be discouraged till he establish justice in the earth. And the coastlands shall wait for his law. Is 42:14\n\nO - Jesus is still working today. I need to look for where and jump in with Him.\n\nA - Good help me to drop all my stuff and follow you.\n\nP - 9 days we soaping and I can feel the void.",
