          "import_seq": 5001,
          "journal_date": "2024-01-01",
          "ocr_text": "All the Loving I have to offer\n\nObservation:\nAll the love I have experienced All the love I have needed \u0026 longed for has come from the Lord. Every moment of love I have received from people has been his grace.\n\nApplications:\nI should recognize that all good gifts come from God \u0026 that He is the source of all love. I can trust Him to provide the love \u0026 companionship I need.\n\nP- Can I help people around me with the love You've blessed me with? I pray that You would help me be a vessel of Your love to all those around me. I pray that all who are hurting would come seeking You for the love \u0026 comfort that only You can provide.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218409790.jpg",
