          "ocr_text": "S - I being My righteousness near, it shall not be far off. My salvation shall not linger. And I will place salvation in Zion, for Israel My praise.\nO - To God it wasn't for all but it was actually over 500yrs off.\nA - Realize God's time table is much larger than mine and be patient.\nP - God thank you for your patience in my life. Help me to be patient with your plan for my life.",
