          "ocr_text": "S - I should I have refined you but not as silver. I have tested you in the furnace of affliction. It's 48:10\nO - All affliction is to refine my character.\nA - I should look at all affliction as something that hurts the flesh but benefits my character.\nP - God help me to appreciate even the path that I go through.",
