          "ocr_text": "S - \"There is no peace\" says the Lord \"For the wicked\"\nO - If a person is struggling to find peace it could be that they are wicked.\nA - I lack peace. I could be doing wicked things. If I have peace it will be because I'm doing what's right.\nP - Lord, help me to always do what is right.",
