          "import_seq": 19003,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-21",
          "ocr_text": "S - For the Lord God will help me. Therefore I will not be disgraced. Therefore I will set my face like a flint. And I know I will not be ashamed. Isaiah 50:7\nO - Isaiah had confidence that was rooted in knowing God would help him. So he was steadfast, immovable. Did not waiver.\nA - All confidence should be rooted in the fact that God will help me. We fail. No disgrace. I will get my face like flint.\nP - God please help me to hear you well and have confidence in the way that you want me to walk. I will walk with confidence once I know you are with me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
