          "import_seq": 19004,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-22",
          "ocr_text": "S - Lift up your eyes to the heavens. And look to the earth beneath. For the heavens will vanish away like smoke. The earth will grow old like a garment and those who dwell in it will die like manna. But my salvation will not be abolished. Isaiah 51:6\nO - Everything is temporary except for salvation and righteousness.\nA - I should value the eternal more than the temporal.\nP - God give me eyes to see the eternal from the temporal. Help me to see what you value and value the same things.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218413614.jpg",
