          "import_seq": 20000,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-23",
          "ocr_text": "S - How beautiful upon the mountains are the feet of them who bring good news, who proclaim peace, who bring glad tidings of good news, who proclaim salvation, who say to Zion \"Your God reigns.\" Is. 52:7\n\nO - There is a beauty to those who spread good news.\n\nA - I should always share the good news to whoever will listen.\n\nP - God, help me to share your good news to anyone and everyone in my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218413748.jpg",
