          "import_seq": 22001,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-30",
          "ocr_text": "S - I have seen his ways, and will heal him. I will also lead him, and restore comforts to him and to his mourners. Is. 57:18\nO - God heals those He loves, then heals and restores. We all do own thing but His love brings us back.\nA - Suffering and pain are good things if they lead us back to Him.\nP - God please draw me back to you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218414118.jpg",
