          "import_seq": 24000,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-06",
          "ocr_text": "S- And they shall be called the Holy People, The Redeemed of the Lord, Sought out, A City Not Forsaken. Is 62:10\nO- Holy, Redeemed, Sought, Not Forsaken.\nA- Sold, Used, Forsaken, Lost. God turns this around and makes it the opposite way. Identity. I can should eat my eyes and focus on what catches attention. Rethink my path.\nP- God help me to FIX my EYES on you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415081.jpg",
