          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "209e15c6-bbba-44c8-9f7f-9b9be513c091",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 20001,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-24",
          "ocr_text": "S - Enlarge the place of your tent. And let your stretch at the curtains of your dwelling. Do not spare. Lengthen your cords. And strengthen your stakes. For you will expand to the right and the left. And your desireth will inherit the nations and make the desolate cities inhabited. Isaiah 54:2-3\n\nO - Enlarge - Stretch - Lengthen - Strengthen - Expand - Inherit - Inhabit. 7 words of limitless thinking. This can be applied physically and spiritually. In the context of Israel, they are a spiritual nation. Both physical and spiritual.\n\nA - I need to break my limited thinking. God wants to break out in my life in all areas.\n\nP - God, help me to press in to all you have for my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218413748.jpg",
