        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:35:06.82316+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "fc03c2d4-0acb-4d03-8297-db73e10de5c5",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 22002,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-31",
          "ocr_text": "S - Is not this the fast that I have chosen to loose the bonds of wickedness, to undo the heavy burdens, to let the oppressed go free and that you break every yoke? Is it not to share you bread with the hungry and that you bring to your house the poor and cast out. When you see the naked that you cover him, and hide not yourself from you own flesh? Then shall your light break forth as the morning your healing shall spring forth, and your righteousness shall go before you. The glory of the Lord shall be your rear guard. Then you shall call and the Lord will answer you will cry and He will say 'here I am'. Is 58:6-9\nO - God created us equally. And wants us to willingly give what we have to help those in need. This contributes to light and salvation and answers to prayer.\nA - Give Shabbies a car, fallen a car, direct funds to Aseph.\nP - Help me to be generous to others.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
