          "import_seq": 20002,
          "journal_date": "2024-03-25",
          "ocr_text": "S - Your children shall be taught by the Lord. And great shall be the peace of your children. In righteousness you shall be established. You shall be far from oppression for you shall not fear. And far from terror for it shall not come near you. Isaiah 54:13, 14\n\nO - Taught, Peace, Righteousness, Established, No Oppression. No Fear. No Terror. Fear-Form leads to oppression. Teaching ⟹ Peace ⟹ Righteousness ⟹ Established.\n\nA - Kids need to learn how to learn. It leads to peace. Righteousness. Establishment.\n\nP - God, please help me to establish and lead my children established in you.\n\nRound Table w/ Steve \u0026 Deborah Murrell\n1, 1st in church one foot on campus.\n46 churches 80notions 1.9% campuses.\nChurches don't plant churches.\nPeople plant churches.\n\nWORK\nChurch ⟹ Pastor ⟹ WORK ⟹ Focus\nTemple ⟹ Priest ⟹ Worship ⟹ Gathering (liturgy/feasts)\nFlock ⟹ Shepherd ⟹ Discipleship ⟹ People (Protection against wolves)\nElders/Overseer ⟹ Leadership ⟹ Mission\n\nWORSHIP ⟹ Singing/Sermon/Sacrifice/Sacraments/Supplants\n\nFill Churches - Form Christ in people.\n\nSpiritual Leadership\nOrganizational Leadership\n\nTheological Discipleship Legal Board Mission Elders Dice 4. I Peter 5:1 - Elders Among you. Feed among elders. Oversight Asbury Lessons • Student led / Elder guided. • Preserve movement that reaches their kids - Not adults.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
