          "ocr_text": "S- In all their affliction He was afflicted. And the angel of His Presence saved them. Is 63:9\nO- God feels pain when we feel pain.\nA- He gives us freedom to choose but still suffers with us in the wrong choices we make. His blood and forgiveness in the wise choices we make. I should try the same.\nP- God, help me to never lose pathy, even for those that make wrong decisions.",
