          "ocr_text": "S- Arise shine for your light has come and the glory of the Lord is risen upon you. For behold, the darkness shall cover the earth and deep darkness the people but the Lord will arise over you and his glory will be seen upon you. Isaiah 60:1-2\n\nO- God's glory is always given to be a blessing to others. When harvest season happens, it's time to give, time to save, time to prepare.\n\nA- know that however dark a situation is, light is coming. God works in seasons. And however bright something is, darkness is coming so prepare.\n\nP- God help me to live in preparation based on prayer not of paranoia. Help to always keep my eyes focused on the next season!",
