          "ocr_text": "S- A little one will become a thousand and a small one a strong nation. I the Lord will hasten it in its time. Isaiah 60:21,22\n\nO- God will multiply His people in the end times. Increase in number as a blessing. Decrease in number is not good.\n\nA- God's initial mandate is to be fruitful and multiply, both physically \u0026 spiritually.\n\nP- Lord help me to be a positive influence to as many people as possible.",
