          "ocr_text": "S- Instead of your shames you shall have double honor And instead of confusion they shall have rejoice in their portion. Therefore in their land they shall possess double. Everlasting joy shall be theirs. Isaiah 61:7\n\nO- God will always turn discipline into blessing in the right time. God does everything for the benefit of His kids.\n\nA- I will trust God in whatever season He places me in knowing that everything He allows in my life is for my good and for my blessing.\n\nP- God help me to trust you in everything that I do.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
