          "ocr_text": "S- As for me says the Lord that's is my covenant with them. My Spirit who is upon you and my words that I have put in your mouth will not depart from your mouth nor the mouth of your descendants nor the mouth of your descendants descendants says the Lord from this time and forever more. Isaiah 59:21\n\nO- God's promises over good. I can trust in Him. He will speak to my birds and my birds\n\nA- kids, I don't need to fear that they will get brainwashed by our culture.\n\nP- God please make me a child like changer. History makers. Leaders in their own generations",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
