          "journal_date": "2024-04-09",
          "ocr_text": "S- As the new wine is found in the cluster and one says 'do not destroy it for a blessing is in it' so will I do for my sake that I may not destroy them all. Is 65:5\nO- Something preserves in a cluster. Something new is formed in the cluster. Value is formed in the cluster.\nA- I will join myself with others. Even if my husband is sacrificed by a righteous wife and vice versa.\nP- Lord help me not to be in solitude. Help me to love others and be part of a community.",
