          "import_seq": 25000,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-11",
          "ocr_text": "S- Before I formed you in the womb, I knew you. Before you were born I sanctified you. I ordained you to be a prophet to the nations.\n\nO- God knows us, set up us apart, has a purpose and a calling for each life.\n\nA- I don't need to find my purpose. I must grow with God and the will reveal it.\n\nP- God, all wisdom, knowledge \u0026 fulfillment comes from you. Help me to grow closer to you. Help me to trust you with my kids and make to find their purpose in you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415224.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415224.jpg"
          ],
