        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:35:43.780739+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "dcb680c1-572e-4e01-9130-637c78aa989f",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 25001,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-12",
          "ocr_text": "S- Then said I, \"Ah Lord God! Behold I cannot speak for I am a youth.\" But the Lord said to me: \"Do not say, I am a youth' for you shall go to all to when I send you, And whatever I command you, you shall speak.\" Jer 1:6-7\n\nO- God uses youth to change the world. David, Jeremiah, Mary, Esther, Joseph. God will use all people. Any race. Any age. Male or Female.\n\nA- Let young people do great things for God. Empower them to change the world.\n\nP- God please give courage and conviction to our young people to stand up for you. Help me to speak life into our youth.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415224.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415224.jpg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Jer 1:6-7",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T02:35:43.712+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:35:43.886558+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "5fb633e9-b3c7-45fc-8706-c66fa064e71b",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 25002,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-13",
          "ocr_text": "S- I remember you. The kindness of your youth, the love of your betrothal when you went after me in the wilderness, in a land not sown says the Lord. The first fruits of his increase. Teat that devour him will offend. Disaster will come upon them' says the Lord. Isa 2:2-3\n\nO- God remembers us. When we were passionate about him, He remembers our daughter.\n\nA- In the same way I miss Jacet's love and desire but value her faithfulness, I can understand God's pain. When I left my first love.\n\nP- God help me to love you the way I did.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415224.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415224.jpg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Isa 2:2-3",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T02:35:43.828+00:00",
