          "import_seq": 27000,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-19",
          "ocr_text": "S - John 1:16 - For the law was given through Moses, but grace and truth came through Jesus Christ\n\nO - We could have a relationship through the law but the law could not keep it. Grace and truth offers a better law. A law of love.\n\nA - I can be loved and accepted even though I love needs to be full of truth.\n\nP - God, help me to be a true reflection of you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415618.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415618.jpg"
          ],
