        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:35:54.905772+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "50abe573-8bd5-444e-a481-65811fbb0c36",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 26001,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-16",
          "ocr_text": "S- James the son of Zebedee and John the brother of James to whom he gave the name Boanerges that is 'Sons of Thunder'. Mark 3:17\nO- Vernon was angry knowing their temperament and knowing it wasn't God's will. They wanted to call fire down from heaven when it wasn't judgement time. Judgment time is coming. True mercy is living life with this lens in mind.\nA- I want to have love, but not love sin. Hate cancer for what it does to the person. Hate drugs for which it does to the user. Hate sin for what it does to the sinner.\nP- God help me to have a heart of mercy and grace to see a judgment coming and to love people enough to sacrifice my rights and my life to get them to heaven.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415414.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415414.jpg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": null,
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T02:35:54.842+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:35:55.186216+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "a74cf4da-7914-435b-bb08-c1444e5ba646",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 26002,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-17",
          "ocr_text": "S- You do not know what manner of spirit you are of. For the Son of Man did not come to destroy men's lives but to save them. And went to another village. Luke 9:55-56\nO- Jesus did stop them because of rejection but went to another village.\nA- When someone doesn't doesn't want to hear about Christ and maybe received with joy they changed their minds it can be discouraging. But Jesus went to another village. I should do the same.\nP- God help me not to be discouraged but to go to the next person who wants to hear and grow.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415414.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415414.jpg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": null,
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T02:35:54.955+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:35:55.313336+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "ff13d953-fcc1-40ad-964b-f95a30281f57",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 26003,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-18",
          "ocr_text": "S- What man of you having a hundred sheep if he loses one of then does not leave the 99 in the wilderness and go after the one which is lost until he finds it. Luke 15:4\nO- Lost sheep are not lovely. But they are loved. There is a war on ideology. It is evil. Real love looks through the lens of death. Real death and spiritual death. Real love doesn't excuse or ignore sin. It hates sin. It sacrifices for the sin of others.\nA- Don't hate sinners. Hate sin for what it does to sinners.\nP- God please give us love to love people different from us.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415414.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415414.jpg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Luke 15:4",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T02:35:55.255+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:36:21.667271+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "50223f19-e8b3-419d-bcd3-df1a1e148758",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 28001,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-24",
          "ocr_text": "S- Hear O Israel. The Lord our God the Lord is one. You shall love the Lord your God with all your heart with all your soul, with all your strength. And these words which I command you today shall be in your heart. You shall teach them diligently to your children and shall talk of them when you sit in your house when you walk by the way, when you lie down, and when you rise up. Deut 6:4-7\n\nO- God gives a commandment to Love. Describes God as ONE God. love with heart, soul, strength. Memorize it. Teach it to children.\n\nA- Heart-Passion, Soul-Mindwill, emotions, strength, Red Heart (Guard it) Soul (Study Discipline), Strength (Serve)\n\nP- God help me to love you with everything I have.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415749.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415749.jpg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Deut 6:4-7",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T02:36:21.414+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:36:21.931123+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "7d1ceecd-a312-45fc-8d27-02c5404b7400",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 28002,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-25",
          "ocr_text": "S- For as we have many members in one body, but all members do not have the same function, so we being many are one body in Christ, and individually members of one another. Having then gifts differing according to the grace that is given to us, let us use them. If prophecy, let us prophesy in proportion to our faith, or ministry let us use it in our ministering. He who teaches in teaching. He who exhorts in exhortation, he who gives with liberality, he who leads with diligence, he who shows mercy with cheerfulness. Rom 12:4-8\n\nO- Everyone has a different gift. Each gift is needed. Each gift is different. These...\n\nA- I should run in the lane God has given me. Not compare myself to others. Know my gifts and develop them. Help others.\n\nP- God help me to serve the body with the gift you gave me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415749.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415749.jpg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Rom 12:4-8",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T02:36:21.729+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:36:22.203721+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "560dd496-4747-413f-af33-34f332dcc641",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 28003,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-26",
          "ocr_text": "S- A man's heart plans his ways but God directs his steps. Prov 16:9\n\nO- We can make plans but God is ultimately in control of how these plans play out.\n\nA- I should plan as much as possible but recognize that the end result is in God's hands. I should do everything to love others and God. To serve them. And leave the rewards to God.\n\nP- God help me to trust you in everything that I am doing.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415749.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415749.jpg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "Prov 16:9",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T02:36:21.98+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:36:33.451212+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "f033e0bc-2e5c-4c71-9549-17fa4b74c692",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 29003,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-30",
          "ocr_text": "S- My Father has been working until now and I have been working... Nast assuredly I says you the son can do nothing of himself but what he sees the Father do, for whatever he does, the son also does in the same... for the Father judges no one but has committed all judgement to the son. John 5:17, 19:22\n\nO- Jesus mirrors the Father but there are different roles they play.\n\nA- In the same way Jesus and the Father love each other, ave one but do different things. I must not put different values on different tasks.\n\nP- Pls give me wisdom to run our start in an equitable way.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218416300.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218416300.jpg"
          ],
          "scripture_reference": "John 5:17, 19:22",
          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T02:36:33.235+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:37:51.013974+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "0fc4d8f0-8c62-4319-ae41-13b46757361f",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 37002,
          "journal_date": "2024-05-29",
          "ocr_text": "S- The king has brought me into his chambers. I:4 He brought me to the banquet hall and his banner over me is love. His beloved\n\nA- Although I am separated from my beloved I can and will wait for His love.\n\nP- God help me to be patient, although I'm not with you. Help me help me to keep faithful to you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218418327.jpg",
