        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:36:06.115254+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "4b03dace-9dee-42ec-ac25-83c7e6fca3c7",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 27001,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-20",
          "ocr_text": "S - Now after 2 days he departed from there and went to Galilee. John 4:43\n\nO - Jesus spent 2 days sharing with the Samaritans. They received him with joy but did not have deep roots. Jesus came back and the blind was closed out. Jesses came for the Jews because their roots are deep. And their eyes were open and they love much Christ.\n\nA - Fruit comes from deep roots. Roots take time. Roots are not seen. Roots provide stability. Roots give sovereignty. Roots.\n\nP - God help me to have and establish deep roots in my team.",
