          "ocr_text": "S - Most assuredly, I say to you, he who believes in me, the works that I do he will do also; and greater works than these he will do because I go to my Father. John 14:12\n\nO - If I truly believe in Christ, then the same things that Jesus did as well, Christians were given that name because Christ.\n\nA - I don't think I resemble Christ that is described in the Bible. There is much more that I can become in Christ.\n\nP - God thank you for giving Jesus as our example and the Holy Spirit to live the way Christ lived.",
