          "ocr_text": "Intro- Thankful for Waipuna and Stawi/Jess.\n9 Thankful for stasis \u0026 friendship\nChris Angie- Thankful for opportunity to close this series.\nDue at projection + concentration\nUnprepared thought leads to unbelief.\nDarling God- Goodness- Word- Power/Ability- Word- Love- Character\nOrigin of\nCause of pain \u0026 suffering- sin- Genesis\nHope in pain \u0026 suffering- ETC- Temporary Fellowship\nTheology of pain \u0026 suffering- Early Church\nWhat is our hope?\nWhen is our hope?\nThe end of pain \u0026 suffering- Revelation",
