          "ocr_text": "S - I will set up shepherds over them who will feed them and they shall fear no more, nor be dismayed nor shall they be lacking says the Lord. Jer 23:4\n\nO - God needed to soften the hearts of the people through suffering to receive leadership that he wanted to give them.\n\nA - People get what they deserve. No such thing as good people and bad leadership. Good people deserve mercy and correction.\n\nP - God, give us grace, mercy, love \u0026 discipline.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
