          "ocr_text": "S- My Father has been working until now and I have been working.. Most assuredly I sow you the son can do nothing of himself but what he sees the Father do, for whatever He does, the Son also does in the same... for the Father judges no one but has committed all judgement to the Son. John 5:17, 19-22\nO- Jesus mirrors the Father but there are different roles they play.\nA- In the same way Jesus and the Father love each other, we one but do different things. I must not put different values on different tasks.\nP- Pls give me wisdom to run our start in an equitable way.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218416300.jpg",
