          "import_seq": 41000,
          "journal_date": "2024-06-10",
          "ocr_text": "S - What is your beloved more than another beloved? O Fairest among women? What's your beloved more than another beloved that you so charge us. SOS 5:9\nO - When she was beaten she didn't bemoan her pain or persecution. She dwelt on his love. I made people want to know what was so special about her beloved.\nA - When I get persecuted or go through pain, I will use it to share my love of Christ.\nP - God help me to love you more.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218419324.jpg",
