          "journal_date": "2024-07-04",
          "ocr_text": "S- There is hope in your future says the Lord. That your children shall come back to their own border. Is 31:19\nO- Sometimes our hope isn't for our own lifetime but for generations later.\nA- I must have an urgency and a great burden, but think generationally.\nP- God please help me to have harvest hands.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218420860.jpg",
