          "import_seq": 48002,
          "journal_date": "2024-07-12",
          "ocr_text": "S - In this place that is desolate, without man and without beast and in all its cities, there shall be again a dwelling place of shepherds causing their flocks to lie down. Is 23:12\n\nO - Desolation of all gives opportunity for shepherds to find space to lead. Both good shepherds and evil.\n\nA - Good shepherds give rest to their sheep. Ps 23. The good shepherd makes to lie down in green pastures, still waters. Restores the soul.\n\nP - Lord, help me to be a good shepherd to the displaced residence of Lahaina",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218421169.jpg",
