          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 50002,
          "journal_date": "2024-07-20",
          "ocr_text": "S- Arise go up to the wealthy nation that dwells secure without gates and bars dwelling alone. That camels shall be for booty and the multitude of their cattle for plunder. I will scatter to all winds those in the farthest corners and I will bring their calamity from all sides says the Lord. Jer 49:31,37\n\nO- Even the wealthy nation can be destroyed and scattered.\n\nA- America could suffer a large military loss. We are not invincible. People of the US could be scattered.\n\nP- Lord help us not to place our security in our wealth but in you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218421626.jpg",
