          "import_seq": 52001,
          "journal_date": "2024-07-27",
          "ocr_text": "S - They also took away the pots the shovels the trimmers the bowls the spoons and all the bronze utensils with which the priest ministered.\nO - Solomon built such amazing things only to have it stolen from a more powerful nation because of incompetent leadership who were evil.\nA - Everything we build will be inherited by another who did no work to build it. Hard times = Strong men, Easy time = Weak men\nP - God, I trust you in all things. Form and mold us in your image.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218422162.jpg",
