          "import_seq": 28000,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-23",
          "ocr_text": "S- Nathanael said to him, \"Can anything good come out of Nazareth?\" Philip said to him, \"Come and see.\" John 1:46\n\nO- Nazareth had a bad reputation. No one thought anything good could come from that place. Phillips response was still to invite Mum.\n\nA- I should always maintain an attitude that the goodness of God will attract people if the come and see Jesus.\n\nP- God help us to be bold to invite. And help us to allow people to see and have an encounter with you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218415749.jpg",
