          "import_seq": 29002,
          "journal_date": "2024-04-29",
          "ocr_text": "S- And in that day his feet will stand on Mt olives which faces Jerusalem on the east. And the Mt olives shall be split two, from the west, making a very large valley. Ha!Q8 the mountain shall move to the north. And half toward the south. Zach 14:4\n\nO- Gods word is sure, everything he says will happen will happen.\n\nA- I must get serious with God.\n\nP- Help me to love you more.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218416300.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218416300.jpg"
          ],
