        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:37:41.235405+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "cef756fd-fad6-4c2e-afac-369369bf9cd5",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 36000,
          "journal_date": "2024-05-23",
          "ocr_text": "S - God and they had stood in my counsel and had caused my people to hear my words, then they would have turned them from their evil way and from their evil doings. Jer 23:21-22\n\nO - Speaking truth is a product of standing in God's counsel. Hearing God leads to speaking His word, then people turning from evil.\n\nA - My job is to hear and speak. I am not responsible for others to listen and obey, but I must speak.\n\nP - God help me to be a better communicator of your word to our world.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218417963.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
