        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:37:41.375745+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "410637ed-3506-4ae1-9834-61b0c1dabe63",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 36001,
          "journal_date": "2024-05-24",
          "ocr_text": "S - I will give them a heart to know me that I am the Lord and they shall be my people and I will be their God for they shall return to me with their whole heart. Jer 24:7\n\nO - This prophecy before the captivity. 600yrs B.C. It is 2600 yrs still awaiting this prophecy. God is patient and kind.\n\nA - I will be patient with myself knowing God is patient with me.\n\nP - Thank you God for your patience but also for your purpose plans remain constant for my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
