          "ocr_text": "S- Remember the Sabbath day to keep it holy. Six days you shall labor and do all your work. Exodus 20:7-8\nO- There should be a day set apart for rest and enjoying God and one another.\nA- We should have a day of rest for electronics, probably Sunday.\nP- God help us to learn to rest.",
