          "ocr_text": "S - Shall I not punish them for these things? says the Lord? shall I not avenge myself on such a nation as this? - Jer 5:29\n\nO - They got fat and didn't help others. They didn't help the needy. God punished them for it.\n\nA - I must get serious about helping the community around me starting with my own staff.\n\nP - God, help me to be a greater blessing to others.",
