          "ocr_text": "S - To whom shall I speak and give warning? That they may hear? Indeed their ears are closed. Behold the word of the Lord is a reproach to them. They have no delight in it. Jer 6:10\n\nO - Ears can be filled with Blood. To hear God, the ear needs to be circumcised. It's painful. Flesh that way needs to be shed. This away sensitivity. Longer it's not taken away the more painful longer it's not taken away, the more it's not an issue. Best it increased uncleanness and chances of infection.\n\nA - Things I fear \u0026 give attention to: social media and the phone. Markets a crypto habits to cut these things out of my life. Things to cut these things out of my life this week.\n\nP - God help me cut these things out of my life this week.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
