          "ocr_text": "S- Though they cry out to me I will not listen to them. They will cry to other gods...but they will not save them at all in the time of trouble. Jer 11:12\nO- True repentance is turning to God without a back up plan.\nA- To be consecrated, I need to let go of all back up plans and rely on Jesus.\nP- God please forgive me for wandering from your ways. Please give me the gift of repentance.",
