          "ocr_text": "S - Perhaps everyone will listen and turn from their ways that I may relent concerning the calamity which I purpose to bring on them because of their evil doings. Jer 26:3\n\nO - If I become so evil that God purposes to remove me, He will have mercy and change it if I change.\n\nA - I will never lose hope in the goodness of God.\n\nP - God thank you that your mercies are new every morning and even in judgment there is love and mercy.",
