          "ocr_text": "S- Judge not that you be not judged. For with what judgment you judge you will be judged and with that measure you use it will be measured back to you. Matt 7:1-2\nO- However we judge other people to, how we will be judged ourselves.\nA- I will focus on myself and improving myself instead of focusing on others who I have no control of. If my life improves it will naturally be attractive and people will follow and change if they want out of their own volition instead of my judgement.\nP- God help me to live the best possible life and serve you with my whole heart.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
