          "ocr_text": "S- Like an earring of gold and an ornament fine gold is a wise rebuke to an obedient ear. A word fitly spoken is like apples of gold in settings of silver. Pro 25:11-2\nO- Correction is beautiful and valuable when it is given and received well.\nA- I need to work to give correction in a way that adds value to others.\nP- God help me to give and receive correction well.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
