          "import_seq": 30002,
          "journal_date": "2024-05-03",
          "ocr_text": "S- Return O backsliding children says the Lord for I am married to you. I will take you, one from a city and two from a family and I will bring you to Zion.\nO- God's commitment to us is never ending. Jer 3:14 He is there for us at all times and faithful even if we are not\nA- I should always feel safe to come to God. Even when I feel I failed. He is loving and gracious.\nP- God thank you for you never ending love for me.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218416495.jpg",
