          "import_seq": 33001,
          "journal_date": "2024-05-13",
          "ocr_text": "S - Stand in the ways and see, and ask for the old paths where the good way is and walk in it. Then you will find rest for your souls. Jer 6:16\n\nO - Stand and observe. What way is producing good fruit? Look at what produced good fruit from the past. Then walk in it. It is there you find rest.\n\nA - Don't look for evil. Look for good. Then copy, fellow, improve upon with a thankful",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218417290.jpg",
