          "import_seq": 35001,
          "journal_date": "2024-05-20",
          "ocr_text": "S - Thus says the Lord \"Take heed to yourselves and bear no burden on the Sabbath day, nor bring it in by the gates of Jerusalem, nor carry a burden on the Sabbath day, nor do any work but hallow the Sabbath day as I commanded your Fathers\" Jer 17:21,22\n\nO - Resting on the Sabbath is important to the Lord. Everyone should rest on the Sabbath. This was the root of Israel going into punishment.\n\nA - Not working on the Sabbath is important. A day to rest and enjoy relationship of family and spiritual family.\n\nP - God help me to prioritize relationship over work and activity.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218417842.jpg",
