          "ocr_text": "For My people are Goulish, They have not known Me. They are silly children, and have no understand. They are wise to do evil, But to do good they have no knowledge. Jer 4:22\n\nO - It's possible to grow in wisdom in things that have no eternal value. God wants us to invest our knowledge of things with true value.\n\nA - Anything eternal is worth investing in and growing in.\n\nP - God help me to be focused on the eternal and not the temporal.",
