          "ocr_text": "S- I will rise now, and go about the city, in the streets, and in the squares. I will seek the one my soul loves. I passed by them when I found the one I love. SOS 3:2-4\nO- She was seeking Him in a place where she knew He was not and asked people she knew would not know. She finds Him unexpectantly and wants to take him to her mother's house. This could be like Jews looking for the messiah in the wrong place but Jesus is then in the city. The Holy Spirit births and is prepared by the Holy Spirit. The Holy Spirit prepares the church to meet the Son.\nA- Jesus told his disciples to go and wait for the holy Spirit. Its the Spirit and the Bride that say come. The Spirit guides us into all truth, and reveals the Son to the church.\nP- God help me to be more in tune with the Spirit.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
