          "ocr_text": "S- Let not the wise man glory in his wisdom let not the mighty man glory in his might Nor let the rich man glory in his riches But let him who glories glory in this. That he understands and knows me. That I am the Lord exercising lovingkindness judgement and righteousness on the earth. for in these I delight says the Lord.\n\nO- Understand and know God. Is more valuable than riches, might, wisdom. This is done through reading the Word \u0026 spending time with God.\nA- I should take more time to spend with God in silence \u0026 solitude.\nP- God help me to hear you. Day in and day out you first. Thank you for family, staff, small group and leadership at church.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
