          "ocr_text": "S - I will set up shepherds over them who will feed them and they shall fear no more, nor be dismayed nor shall they be lacking says the Lord.\n\nO - God needed to soften the hearts of the people through suffering to receive leadership that he wanted to give them.\n\nA - People get what they deserve. No such thing as good people and bad leadership. People deserve mercy, love \u0026 discipline\n\nP - God, give us grace, mercy, love \u0026 discipline.",
