          "import_seq": 42003,
          "journal_date": "2024-06-17",
          "ocr_text": "S - Do not stir or awaken love until it pleases. Love is as strong as death. Many waters cannot quench love. SOS 8:4, 1.\n\nO - Love is a powerful force. It can be awakened before the time it should awake, as it goes lustful. God, eyes bride of life is not love. It is used to awake desire before its time. It cannot be controlled once it is awake.\n\nA - It should be reserved for the right person. It shouldn't be awakened by the wrong thing or wrong person.\n\nP - God help my love to be given 100% to you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
