          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 31002,
          "journal_date": "2024-01-01",
          "ocr_text": "Thomas Rainer\n92% of churches are under 250 in attendance.\n360k churches in America.\n\nDecline/conversion growth. Not attractional or transfer\n• How to convert - Evangelism 4 Hope initiative?\n\n2. Discouragement is still pervasive.\n• Post Covid\n\n3. Demographics are moving in favor \u0026 these churches.\n• It's not about the neighborhood anymore.\n• Work from home\n• Millennials- Not moving around. Desire to be local\n• Neighborhood churches because rural area is growing\n\n4. Challenge is changing to reach existing and new communities.\n• New people are moving in. Who is reaching them? Who is leaving?\n• What are the needs of these people?\n• Just cause they are coming doesn't mean we are ready to reach them.\n\n5. Leader not aware about deferred maintenance.\n• AC System\n• Irrigation",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218416939.jpg",
