          "import_seq": 32003,
          "journal_date": "2024-05-11",
          "ocr_text": "That have grown fat, they are sleek. Yes they surpass the deeds of the wicked. They do not plead the cause, the cause of the fatherless Yet they prosper and the right of the needy they do not defend. Shall I not punish them for these things? says the Lord? Shall I not avenge myself on such a nation as this? - Jer 5:29\n\nO - They got fat and didn't help others. They didn't help the needy. God punished them for it.\n\nA - I must get serious about helping the community around me starting with my own staff.\n\nP - God help me to be a greater blessing to others.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218417094.jpg",
