          "ocr_text": "S- Thagh they cry out to me I will not listen to them. They will cry to other gods... but they will not save them at all in the time of trouble. Satellite\nO- True repentance is turning to God without a back up plan.\nA- To be consecrated, I need to let go of all back up plans and rely on Jesus.\nP- God please forgive me for wording from your ways. Please give me the gift of repentance.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
