          "import_seq": 43003,
          "journal_date": "2024-06-21",
          "ocr_text": "S- You who dwell in the gardens, the companions listen for your voice. Let me hear it. Make haste my beloved and be like a gazelle or a young stag on the mountains of spices. SOS 8:13-14\n\nO- Although others were listening for His voice, she was not beloved.\n\nA- How can everyone be this in love with Jesus? How can it be special without it being monogamous?\n\nP- God help me understand the relationship I have with you on an individual basis vs a corporate basis. Let us be one as you and the father are one. Help us to be the bride you called us to be.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218419859.jpg",
