          "import_seq": 45002,
          "journal_date": "2024-06-29",
          "ocr_text": "S - Build houses and dwell in them. Plant gardens and eat their fruit. Take wives and beget sons and daughters. Take wives for your sons and your daughters to husbands so they shall bear sons \u0026 daughters that you may increase and not be diminished. And seek peace of the city. Jer 29:5-6\n\nO - Houses, gardens, multiply, increase. Seek Peace.\n\nA - wives, having to stay over, build homes, plant gardens, have kids.\n\nP - God, give me wisdom to be able to live without money.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218420335.jpg",
