          "import_seq": 47001,
          "journal_date": "2024-07-07",
          "ocr_text": "S- Those who hate me without cause are more than the hairs on my head. They are mighty who would destroy me. Being wrong exempts wrongfully. Though I have stolen nothing I still must restore it.\n\nO- Guilt or reproach cannot exist in two places at the same time. Either it is on me or it is on Christ.\n\nA- It is too much for me to bear. I must give it to God.\n\nP- Jesus, I give you all of my guilt and shame. Thank you that you can restore 100% of what I owe.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218421065.jpg",
