          "import_seq": 35000,
          "journal_date": "2024-05-19",
          "ocr_text": "S - And it shall be if THEY [cognomen/name] will learn carefully the ways of my people, to swear by my name. As the Lord lives, as they taught my people to swear by Baal then they shall be established in the midst of my people.\n\nO - God wanted all to repent. Not just Israel. Repentance was required for acceptance. Israel was to teach their ways to the foreigner. NOT vice versa.\n\nA - We must love, but we must live and teach our covenants to others.\n\nP - God help me to be an agent of change in this island.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218417842.jpg",
