          "import_seq": 37000,
          "journal_date": "2024-05-27",
          "ocr_text": "S- Let him kiss me w/ the kisses of his mouth. For your love is better than wine. SOS 1:2.\n\nO- She expresses desire for intimacy with her beloved, that his love is more intoxicating than wine.\n\nA- There is something deeply desirable and healing in the love of Jesus. His love is something that satisfies and is better than anything else.\n\nP- Lord help me to desire you above all else.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218418327.jpg",
