          "import_seq": 40001,
          "journal_date": "2024-06-08",
          "ocr_text": "S- Go forth, O daughters of Zion. And see king Solomon with the crown, with which his mother crowned him. On the day of his wedding. The day of the gladness of his heart. SOS 3:11\nO- Who is Solomon's mother? She is Bathsheba. She committed adultery with David. She was bathing naked. She may have known.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218419186.jpg",
