          "import_seq": 42000,
          "journal_date": "2024-06-14",
          "ocr_text": "S - And the roof of your mouth like the best wine. The wine goes down smoothly for my beloved, moving gently the lips of sleepers. I am my beloved and his desire is toward me. SOS 7:9.\n\nO - The joy of love between a man and woman is experienced between Jesus and his bride. the world has corrupted the beauty and purity of this kind of love.\n\nA - I need to be cleansed of all impure thoughts and emotions and desires to experience the joy of intimacy with Jesus.\n\nP - Jesus forgive me for all my sins. Help me to be in love with you the way the bride is.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218419634.jpg",
