          "import_seq": 45004,
          "journal_date": "2024-07-01",
          "ocr_text": "S - And you will seek me and find me when you search for me with all your heart. Jer 29:13\n\nO - God is found when we seek Him all our hearts\n\nA - Sometimes the only way to seek Him w the whole heart is to subtract things, that are there\n\nP - God give me a heart totally devoted to you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218420335.jpg",
