          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "aa9cb225-1066-40e6-a03b-b9ec1f49c6cd",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 47003,
          "journal_date": "2024-07-09",
          "ocr_text": "S- Call to me and I will answer you and show you great and mighty things which you do not know.\n\nO- While Jeremiah was in prison, God gave him visions of the future of Israel. Health, healing, peace and truth. Verified and confirmed w/ God's covenant with clay and night.\n\nA- In my loss? the loss of Lahaina? God wants me to call on him to show the great and mighty things.\n\nP- God help me to see the beauty past the ashes, that we might be trees of righteousness that should be glorified.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218421065.jpg",
