          "import_seq": 49003,
          "journal_date": "2024-07-17",
          "ocr_text": "S - Do not seek great things for yourself. Do not seek then for behold I will bring adversity on all flesh but will give your life to you as a prize in all places wherever you go. Jer 45:5\n\nO - Seems like God is telling Baruch that the greatest treasure is himself and not to look outside for greatness because God wants to make him great.\n\nA - I need to realize who God is calling me to be is not outside but inside me.\n\nP - God thank you that you put your spirit in me and that my greatness is in who you made me to be.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218421437.jpg",
