          "import_seq": 36001,
          "journal_date": "2024-05-24",
          "ocr_text": "S - I will give them a heart to know me, that I am the Lord and they shall be my people and I will be their God for they shall return to me with their whole heart. Jer 26:7\n\nO - This prophecy is before the captivity. 600yrs BC, it is 2600 yrs later still awaiting this prophecy. God is patient and kind.\n\nA - I will be patient with myself knowing God is patient with me.\n\nP - Thank you God for your patience but also \u0026 your purpose plans remain constant for my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218417963.jpg",
