          "journal_date": "2024-06-01",
          "ocr_text": "S- If you do not know O fairest among women, follow in the footsteps of the flock. And feed your little goats beside the shepherd's tents. SOS 1:6\nO- He sees her opposite of her deepest insecurity. He says to follow His clock and take care of her own goats.\nA- We find Christ when we listen to His voice and believe what He says. When we follow others why call Him and steward our flock the way He does.\nP- God help me to follow and to lead ad listen.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218418567.jpg",
