          "import_seq": 39002,
          "journal_date": "2024-06-05",
          "ocr_text": "S - Rise up my love, my fair one. And come away. For winter is past. The rain is over and gone. Flowers appear on the earth, the time of singing is come. The turtledove is heard in the land, the fig puts forth her green figs, the vine with tender grapes gives it a good smell. Rise up my love, my fair one and come away. 2OS 2:10-13\nO - Creation \u0026 nature is cooperating with the groom. The time iscame. It's time to enjoy one another\nA - God created the world and everything in it to be enjoyed with Him\nP - Help me not to get distracted with material things. These things cannot bring happiness. Only spending time w/ you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218418984.jpg",
