          "import_seq": 41002,
          "journal_date": "2024-06-12",
          "ocr_text": "S - Who is she who looks God as the morning fair as the moon, Clear as the sun, Awesome as an army with Banners? SOS 6:10\nO - It seems only nature can describe the beauty of this woman and the shepherd mocks the king. Saying she is better than all the women he has and his advance was stupid.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218419324.jpg",
