          "import_seq": 43001,
          "journal_date": "2024-06-19",
          "ocr_text": "S- My mother's sons were angry at me. They made me keeper of the vineyards but my own vineyard I have not kept. SOS 1:6\n\nO- What would a vineyard like this exist? Jezreel Valley close to Shunem. Place of Naboth was murdered. Megiddo valley. Last place of the battle of Armageddon.\n\nA- The last stand is the stand of the Bride being united with the groom. The bride \u0026 groom will win.\n\nP- Lord help me to see the battle as serious.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218419859.jpg",
