          "import_seq": 45000,
          "journal_date": "2024-06-27",
          "ocr_text": "S - Nothing is better for a man than to eat and drink and that his soul should enjoy good things. Also, this nice I read from the hand of God. Ecc 2:24\n\nO - Solomon saw that all his labor for wealth could be left to someone who didn't work for it and that he would die like the fool.\n\nA - All people will meet the same end. Treat all people equally and enjoy the simple things in life.\n\nP - God help me to love people and love you more",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218420335.jpg",
