          "import_seq": 52003,
          "journal_date": "2024-07-29",
          "ocr_text": "S - The Lord was like an enemy, He has swallowed up Israel, He has swallowed up all her palaces; He has destroyed her strongholds, and has increased mourning and lamentation in the daughter of Judah Lamentations 2:5\nO - God allowed Israel to suffer. He allowed Jesus to suffer. He will allow His church to suffer. Lamentations and suffering is a purification process. Through pain you will bring for children.\nA - Don't be surprised by pain. Every one will experience it. Will we be formed by it or destroyed by it?\nP - Lord help me to respond in the right way to suffering.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218422162.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
