          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "bd45adf9-f817-46af-99fc-e154180276c5",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 35002,
          "journal_date": "2024-05-21",
          "ocr_text": "S - The instant I speak concerning a nation and concerning a kingdom to pluck up and to pull down and to destroy it, if that nation against whom I have spoken turns from its evil, I will relent of the disaster that I thought to bring upon it. Speak also to the land and kingdom to build and plant it, if it that nation against whom I have spoken does not obey my voice then I will relent concerning the good which I said I would benefit it.\n\nO - Righteous call 7 times \u0026 get torn up, but take heed when you return I won't come back. Word always conditional. His blessings and His curse. Blessings if we follow and curses, if we disobey.\n\nA - I would act as if blessings are permanent. I went fixed punishment is forever.\n\nP - God help me to always walk toward you and seek a growing and deepening relationship with you.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218417842.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218417842.jpg"
