          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 39000,
          "journal_date": "2024-06-03",
          "ocr_text": "S - Imagery of the vineyard\nImagery of king vs shepherd\nImagery of lilies\nO - Vineyard represents the fruitfulness of a person's life.\nKing and shepherd represent World \u0026 Jesus\nLilies represent beauty of creation.\nA - He's alive we are the branches. We can do nothing except through abiding in him\nHe is the shepherd that affirms our beauty. We don't need anything added to our lives\nP - Lord help me to be like this woman who was in love with the shepherd.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218418984.jpg",
