          "import_seq": 40003,
          "journal_date": "2024-06-09",
          "ocr_text": "S- The watchmen who went about the city found me and wounded me. The keepers of the walls took my veil away from me. SOS 5:7\nO- The beloved led and in pursuit of Him she gets persecuted. She then evangelizes about he love of the Shepherd.\nA- We will get persecuted by the watchmen. It will give us opportunity to share about our love for Christ and get other to love Christ.\nP- God, help me to love you and make you known through every shattering of my life.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218419186.jpg",
          "photo_urls": [
            "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218419186.jpg"
