          "source": "imported",
          "summary": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-07-05T02:37:54.592+00:00",
          "visibility": "private"
        },
        {
          "created_at": "2026-07-05T02:37:55.676453+00:00",
          "date_precision": "day",
          "date_reviewed": false,
          "id": "de1967f4-5999-4936-9f96-26df307eaa9c",
          "import_batch_id": "0a60c730-b41f-4aa3-af6f-52f2927c7034",
          "import_seq": 46000,
          "journal_date": "2024-07-02",
          "ocr_text": "S- This captivity is long. Build houses and dwell in them. Plant gardens and eat their fruit. Jer 29:28\nO- God was telling the exiled, build homes in the land you have been scattered in. Plant gardens. Make shelters and a food source. The rebuild will take time.\nA- Labraina people are scattered. What are their skill sets? What can they do? What is the demand on Maui? What is the natural resources? We need farmers, Entrepreneurs, Government officials.\nP- God help me to be a blessing to our community.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218420860.jpg",
