          "ocr_text": "S - I will bring it health and healing. I will heal the city and reveal to them an abundance of peace and truth. Jeremiah 33:6\n\nO - When we are healed we are able to see abundance and peace. When we are wounded we don't see abundance or peace. We see the opposite.\n\nA - In every situation there is abundance and peace.\n\nP - God please heal us and help us to see your abundance. Give us peace.",
