          "import_seq": 38000,
          "journal_date": "2024-05-31",
          "ocr_text": "S- Tell me, O you whom I love, where you feed your flock, where you make it rest at noon. For why should I be as one who veils herself by the flocks of your companions? SOS 1:7\nO- Jesus was working. He was doing His work. He was standing. Jesus had companions. Jesus didn't forsake His call to find His bride. He weathered for His bride was revealed by her seeking Him out. Jesus called His disciples to join His mystery. Jesus also had companions \u0026 friends.\nA- Be on mission. Don't like your Samson. Be like Jesus. The right person brought to you. Love isn't two people staring at each other but two people holding hands walking in the same direction. Peg led the outcast to follow the truth \u0026 the problem to Jesus. help me to pursue what you pursue. Not get you to pursue what I pursued.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218418567.jpg",
