          "import_seq": 39001,
          "journal_date": "2024-06-04",
          "ocr_text": "S - His fruit was sweet to taste.\nO - She tasted His fruit. And it was good.\nA - Genesis starts with a woman having a choice to make between 2 tree. The tree of Life and the tree of the knowledge of good and evil. She sees it is, good for food, good to the eyes \u0026, good to make one wise. Solomon represents that tree. Pharaohs clarify, many wives and much gold. She tastes of the tree of life and it is sweet to taste.\nP - Help me to be like the Shulamite woman and to ignore the flesh Eyes Pride.",
