          "ocr_text": "S - I am my beloved and my beloved is mine He feeds his flock among the lilies SOS 1:3\nO - Her voice has changed to becoming more self less. She now belongs to him.\nA - As I seek \u003e pursue Him, I will give myself to Him in a greater way.\nP - Help me to be selfless in my heart toward you.",
