          "journal_date": "2024-06-18",
          "ocr_text": "S- As a loving deer and a graceful doe, let her breast satisfy you at all times. And always be enraptured by her love. Prov 5:19\nYour two breasts are like two fawns twins of a gazelle. Song 4:5\n\nO- Solomon is the one who compares her to the doe and fawns.\n\nA- Love for the beloved has no comparison\n\nP- Help me to love you the way you love me. With no comparison.",
