          "import_seq": 48003,
          "journal_date": "2024-07-13",
          "ocr_text": "S - Then you turned and profaned my name and every man who had set his male and female slaves whom he had set at liberty, at their pleasure and brought them back into subjection to be your male and female slaves. Ver 24:6\n\nO - Israel acted like Pharaoh and God unleashed plague on them just like Egypt.\n\nA - God wants his people to love Him. The only Christ wants to enslave people to work and serve him. It's important to be on God's side to free people to serve him.\n\nP - God give me wisdom to work with you and for you to help people trust you as Lord and Savior.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783218421169.jpg",
