          "ocr_text": "S- The iniquity of Israel shall be sought but there shall be none. And the sins of Judah but they shall not be found. For I will pardon whom I preserve. Jer 50:20\n\nO- Purifying fire of Isaiah 4,5. Revival fire replacing natural fire. P.Dornans vision, Hand cleanse\n\nA- Trust in God to purify my heart and life.\n\nP- God give me grace to love and please you in all I do. purify my heart. Thank you Jesus for your love.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
