          "ocr_text": "S - I quickened you under the apple tree. There your mother brought you forth. There she who bore you brought you forth. She who loves you brought you forth.\n\nO - There is labor and pain of the Holy Spirit to carry the church and to give birth to it. The church is to make her ready for Jesus.\n\nA - I need to appreciate, honor and be sensitive to the Holy Spirit because it is her job to form me into Christ's image.",
