          "import_seq": 57005,
          "journal_date": "2024-08-13",
          "ocr_text": "S- And I will set my face against them. They will go out from one fire but another fire shall devour them. Then you shall know that I am the Lord when I set my face against them. Thus I will make the land desolate because they have persisted in unfaithfulness says the Lord.\n\nO- There is no escape from judgement when it is time.\n\nA - Rather than trying to escape fire, try to be faithful instead.\nP - Lord help me to be faithful to you in everything I do.",
