          "ocr_text": "So the appearance of the bow that is in the cloud in the day of rain, so was the appearance of the brightness round about. This was the appearance of the likeness of the glory of the Lord. And when I saw it, I fell upon my face, and I heard a voice of one that spake.\n\nO- Prophets seem to have been activated Ez 1:28 during the lowest parts of Israel's history. Isaiah, Jeremiah, Ezekial, Daniel, Ezra were all during the lowest times of Temple history. These prophets spoke of the past (Lucifer), and the future (Christ). It seems when we are stripped of our past and the hope of the future, we are in a place to see from a supernatural perspective. When we lose physical protection, we receive prayer protection. Gal 5: Spirit fights against flesh. Uke vii. If we want heaven, we need to exchange the earthly things.\n\nA- Fasting, giving, declaring healing in Jesus are all ways to weaken the flesh.\n\nP- Help me to live in the Spirit. Not in the flesh.",
