          "ocr_text": "S - Then He said to me, 'Son of man, have you seen what Israel, elders of the house do in the dark, every man in the room of his idols? For they say, The Lord has forsaken the land of Israel.'\n\nO - God showed the prophet Ezekiel the size of Israel's leadership. He did this before the punishment. God is gracious but doesn't overlook sin.\n\nA - I need to teach grace but also holiness and the hatred of sin.\n\nP - God thank you for your grace but also for your holiness \u0026 righteousness. Help me to hate sin like you and to love mercy \u0026 righteousness like you.",
