          "ocr_text": "O- Jesus is calling the bride after a long winter to rise up. The harvest is coming. A time of rejoicing.\n\nA- During the winter everything dies. During summer everything grows. When everything grows, love is tested.\n\nP- God, help me to be devoted to you in times of Gaming and times of harvest. Help me to always maintain a heart devoted to you.\n\nEvery story has a father, a son, a house, a field and a barn. God's called us into the house, to jump into a field to store in a barn to bless the poor.\n\nHear God (Prophetic grace for others.)\nTruth \u0026 Prophetic is different.\nHumility \u0026 Prophetic. We ask, He answers.\n\nProv 6- Don't back up people w/ bad behavior. Don't shake hands w/ a stranger. Savior = Oppressor. If I buy my own lies, I'll buy someone else's lie.\n\nPoverty finds laziness. Prosperity finds diligence.\n\nIf you do what is right, you'll be accepted.\n\nSodom = People for money. Salem = Money for people. God went to Abraham before judging Sodom.",
