          "journal_date": "2024-01-01",
          "ocr_text": "Thomas Rainer\n92% of churches are under 250 in attendance.\n36% churches in America\nDecline in total growth. Not attractional or transfer.\n• How to convert- Evangelism \u0026 Hope initiative?\n\n2. Discouragement is still pervasive.\n- Post covid-\n\n3. Demographics are moving in favor of these churches.\n• It's not about the methodology or more.\n• Work from home\n• Millennials- Not moving around.- Desire to be local\n• Neighborhood churches because rural area is growing\n\n4. Challenge is changing to reach existing and new communities.\n• New people are moving in. Who is reaching them? Who is leaving?\n• What are the needs of these people?\n• Just cause they are coming doesn't mean we are ready to reach them.\n\n5. Leader not aware about deferred maintenance.\n• AC System\n• Irrigation",
