          "ocr_text": "1. David brought his pain and petition to God.\n   • No condemnation. Knew he was wrong but trusted that God loved \u0026 heard him.\n\n2. Added Planted hope in eternity. I shall go to him. But he shall not return to me.\n\n3. Comforted others in pain - Didn't isolate Ahithophel but sat with others.\n\n4. Solomon was born.\n\n1. Petition God in your pain - God hears. Don't listen to any voices of guilt and condemnation. Don't let anything distance you from God.",
