          "journal_date": "2025-01-01",
          "ocr_text": "Dallas Willard- AA got 12 steps from church. The church needs them back.\n\n2 Elements\n1. Fellowship - Israel - Church\n2. Program - Torah - NT-              Steven Hayes\n                                                (Way cool church like org meeting\nNeed a sponsor (discipler-Coach)    like meetings)\n                                                DJ Rockhoffler\n1. Powerless over ___ lives become unmanageable    1. Fellowship\n   , Ask wife \"What do I need to work on ?\"        2. Program\n\n2. Believe greater Power - came to believe- restore us to sanity\n   • Do you believe God can make me sane?\n\n3. Make decision to give ourselves to care of God.     I can't\n   • Our will                                          He can't\n   • Surrender control to higher power.               Let him\n\n4. Make a fearless moral inventory of ourselves\n   searching\n   • Use Ten Commandments /\n   • Write it down.\n\nPerson you upset | Event | Threatened | My response\n                  |      |            | by:\n\n5. Admit to God, myself \u0026 1 other person, exact nature of wrongs\n   I can only be loved to the extent that I'm known.\n   • Confessing \u0026 sharing past mistakes  • Quality of hour being known.\n\n6. Entirely Were entirely read to have God remove all these\n   \u0026 defects of character\n\n7. Humbly ask God to remove my short comings.\n   seek help in addressing personal flaws.\n\n8. Make a list of all persons we have harmed and become willing\n   to make amends to them all. Include exact nature of harm.\n\n9. Made direct amends to all people I have harmed. Except when\n   to do so would injure them or others. TAKE ACTION",
