          "ocr_text": "S- And with all unrighteous deception among those who perish because they did not (receive) the love of the devils, that they might be saved. II Truess 1:10\n\nO- Don't even need to reject truth, we just used to not LOVE TRUTH. We need to RECEIVE the LOVE TRUTH.\n\nA- I need to (receive) a LOVE of TRUTH. David Loved the WORD because He read it. As we read it, we begin to love it.\n\nP- God, help me to plunge on your word to love your word.",
