          "import_seq": 10000,
          "journal_date": "2025-01-01",
          "ocr_text": "David Ward Thoughts:\n1. Fathers Eyes\n2. No condemnation\n3. Love keeps no record of wrongs\n4. God is love\n5. Matt 6 - What you haven't done he won't remember what you have done he won't forget\n6. What you attach neg emotion you'll avoid.\n\nFoot Hole of Community with work in between.\n\nIllustrations\nWord Picture - crushed olives\nUse elsewhere -\nRe-enact metaphor - so they can feel it\nReserved metaphor - use that metaphor in modern days\nForce metaphor\nVignettes - Pieces of a story - Threshold not - 3 stories woven together - Hit many stages of life\nParables - Recognize stories in life\nOthers Story\nScenes - Movies\nQuotes\n\nHonor your Father\nWeight of Glory - Meaning a Feeling Respect Weight Heavy\nTo Make Heavy, Honor = Reward Heavy",
