          "import_seq": 12001,
          "journal_date": "2025-10-29",
          "ocr_text": "S- We know that we are of God and the whole world lies under the sway of the soul the wicked one. And we know that the Son of God has come and hes given us an understanding that we may know Him who is true and we are in Him who is true in His Son Jesus Christ. This is the true God and eternal life. Little children, keep yourselves from idols. 1 John 5:19-21\n\nO- Knowing Christ is knowing the Son of God and is life. Everything else is a counterfeit. Idols pull us from truth and life which is deception and death.\n\nA- The way to life is not by avoiding lies and death but pursuing Christ. As I pursue Christ, I pursue truth and with truth, life.\n\nP- God I need you to work in my heart. To purge and rip out all that is not of You. Help me to keep myself from all idols that pull at my heart.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213344699.jpeg",
