          "ocr_text": "S- Flee youthful lusts but pursue righteousness. Faith, love, peace with those who call on the Lord out of a pure heart. 2 Tim 2:22\nO- It's not just about fleeing lust, but pursuing righteousness. Running from bad also running toward.\nA- How do I pursue righteousness? Holy Spirit. Faith- The Word. Peace? Sow Peace. Pure heart? Guard my heart.\nP- God, help me to guard my heart! Pursue peace. Read my word, and Follow the Spirit.",
