          "import_seq": 7000,
          "journal_date": "2025-02-21",
          "ocr_text": "S-Paul an apostle of Jesus Christ by the will of God to the saints who are in ephesus, and faithful in Christ Jesus. Grace to you and peace from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. Eph 1:1-7\n\nO - He identifies who he is, the authority by which he comes, his mission and who his audience is and what his message is.\n\n1. Man - Paul          Man - Paul\n2. Mandate/Mission    Mission - Purpose - Eph Christ\n3. Market            Mandate - Authority - Under God\n4. Message           Market - Audience - Saints S-Faithful\n                     Message - Grace\n\nA - I'll do all my intros with this format.\n\nMessenger - Jonavan\nMessage - Help Rams guys to succeed in life\nMandate - God's Word\nMarket - Rams quarters\nMessage - Toward your time/talent/treasure well\n\nP - God please help me to be a blessing tonight\n\nIntro - Jonavan Pastor - 3rd generation local. Make a teachers salary. Never made more than a teachers salary.\n\nGrandparents - Restaurant owners, real estate, Gas stations, Auto Parts \u0026 Stock market. Dad Islami aged → full time ministry.\n\n• Desire for ministry - marketplace. Dad - Bivocational Rule of 72%. Not keep much you make but what you do with what you make. Remi doubled @ is more than 1 million dollars. 2 million.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212503678.jpeg",
