          "import_seq": 14001,
          "journal_date": "2025-01-01",
          "ocr_text": "Kingdom is treasure in the field to sell everything for\nto extract value from.\n  - Bernard of Clairvaux 4 stages\n\n1. Love self for self. Humans to feel good about yourself\n2. Love God for self. Use God for me.\n3. Love God for God - Unconditional\n   Love of God\n4. Love self for Gods Sake - Laying everything and everyone with\n   the same love that God has. Including ourselves.\n\nThis is NOT Self Esteem and Self love.\n\nStaying in the game is growing in Gods LOVE.\n\nSymtoms of NOT Growing\nPetition vs Adoration\nJoyful disappointment vs Devastated (Endians indicate things\n                                        that are not in place)\nFatigue vs Burnout          Lazy Goals\n\nWhen I am in pain, \"How do I find God here?\"\n\nBeginning Test: Test of Self Centeredness\nFinish Test: Test of Justified Self Centeredness.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
