          "import_batch_id": "26adde45-a133-4198-af20-eb3e8e9fee55",
          "import_seq": 11000,
          "journal_date": "2025-03-05",
          "ocr_text": "S- Finally, all of you be of one mind having compassion for one another, love as brothers, be tenderhearted, be cautious not returning evil or reviling for reviling but on the contrary blessing, knowing that you were called to this that you may inherit a blessing. I Pet 3:8,9\n\nO- When we live, compassion, Forgive, we position ourselves to get a blessing from the Lord.\n\nA- I didn't know there was a promise of inheritance in living a life of compassion, forgiveness and love. More motivational to live like Jesus.\n\nP- Lord thank you for loving me and promising a blessing to me to love like you. Being like you is a reward in itself but awesome to have an additional promise of inheritance.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212592357.jpeg",
