          "import_batch_id": "26adde45-a133-4198-af20-eb3e8e9fee55",
          "import_seq": 13001,
          "journal_date": "2025-11-01",
          "ocr_text": "S- Guard your heart with all diligence for out of it will flow every issue of life.\n\nO- My heart controls my desires. What I put into my heart controls my desires. Eze saw the Runt. Samson spent time w/ Delilah. She pleased him. David saw Bathsheba from his roof top. They saw. The desired. Their hearts corrupted. David prayed for a pure heart and united desires.\n\nA- Integrity= Integer = consistent. One heart. One desire. One focus. I must guard \u0026 protect my heart.\n\nP- God please help me to have a united heart to fear your name.",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783213391024.jpeg",
